ssion Messages\",\"description\":\"Session-level messages in the Starbase Binary API: logon and sequence-number handling, weekly sequence reset, heartbeat, logout, and session rejects.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"session\",\"logon\",\"logout\",\"heartbeat\",\"resend\",\"gap fill\",\"reject\",\"sequence reset\",\"resetSeqNum\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Session Messages\",\"og:description\":\"Session-level messages for establishing, maintaining, and terminating connections in the Starbase Binary API.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Session Messages\",\"twitter:description\":\"Session-level messages for the Starbase Binary API including logon, logout, heartbeat, and resend.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/session-messages\"}]},{\"group\":\"Order Entry Messages\",\"expanded\":false,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Placing a New Order\",\"description\":\"Submit new orders via the Starbase Binary API. Covers NewOrderRequest, NewOrderResponse, and NewOrderReject messages, including supported order types and flags.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"NewOrderRequest\",\"NewOrderResponse\",\"NewOrderReject\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Placing a New Order\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to placing new orders in Starbase Binary API including request, response, and reject messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Placing a New Order\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to placing new orders in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/placing-new-order\"},{\"title\":\"Amending an Order\",\"description\":\"Amend existing orders using the Starbase Binary API including AmendOrderRequest, AmendOrderResponse, and AmendOrderReject messages.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"AmendOrderRequest\",\"AmendOrderResponse\",\"AmendOrderReject\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Amending an Order\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to amending existing orders in Starbase Binary API including request, response, and reject messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Amending an Order\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to amending existing orders in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/amending-order\"},{\"title\":\"Cancelling an Order\",\"description\":\"Cancel a working order with the Starbase Binary API. Covers CancelOrderRequest, CancelOrderResponse, and CancelOrderReject message flow and error codes.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"CancelOrderRequest\",\"CancelOrderResponse\",\"CancelOrderReject\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Cancelling an Order\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to cancelling orders in Starbase Binary API including request, response, and reject messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Cancelling an Order\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to cancelling orders in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/cancelling-order\"},{\"title\":\"Mass Quotes\",\"description\":\"Submit many two-sided quotes in one Starbase Binary API message with MassQuoteRequest, MassQuoteResponse, and MassQuoteReject message details.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"MassQuoteRequest\",\"MassQuoteResponse\",\"MassQuoteReject\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Mass Quotes\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to placing multiple quotes in Starbase Binary API including request, response, and reject messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Mass Quotes\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to placing multiple quotes in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/mass-quotes\"},{\"title\":\"Starbase Mass Cancel Messages\",\"description\":\"Cancel many Starbase orders and quotes at once using MassCancelRequest, MassQuoteCancelRequest, and the currency_pair_id sourced from InstrumentDefinition.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"MassCancelRequest\",\"MassCancelResponse\",\"MassCancelReject\",\"MassQuoteCancelRequest\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Mass Cancel\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to cancelling multiple orders and quotes in Starbase Binary API including request, response, and reject messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Mass Cancel\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to cancelling multiple orders and quotes in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/mass-cancel\"}]},{\"group\":\"Market Data Messages\",\"expanded\":false,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Maintaining the order book\",\"description\":\"Maintain order books using the Starbase Binary API including Buy Put, Sell Put, Buy Amount Reduced, Sell Amount Reduced, and Order Delete messages.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"market data\",\"order book\",\"Buy Put\",\"Sell Put\",\"Order Delete\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Maintaining the order book\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to maintaining order books in Starbase Binary API including incremental updates and order deletions.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Maintaining the order book\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to maintaining order books in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/order-book-maintenance\"},{\"title\":\"Trades\",\"description\":\"Trade messages on the Starbase Binary API. Covers Trade Summary, Trade, and Block Trade feeds, including execution details and counterparty data for reporting.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"market data\",\"trades\",\"Trade Summary\",\"Trade\",\"Block Trade\",\"block trade\",\"Block RFQ\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Trades\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to trade messages in Starbase Binary API including Trade Summary, Trade, and Block Trade messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Trades\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to trade messages in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/trades\"},{\"title\":\"Starbase Reference Data and Instrument Definitions\",\"description\":\"Instrument metadata for the Starbase Binary API, including InstrumentDefinition fields, index and mark price sources, and quantityExponent snapshot behavior.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"market data\",\"reference data\",\"InstrumentDefinition\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Reference Data\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to reference data in Starbase Binary API including InstrumentDefinition messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Reference Data\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to reference data in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/reference-data\"}]},{\"group\":\"Unsolicited Events\",\"expanded\":false,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Starbase Unsolicited Events\",\"description\":\"Server-initiated Starbase Binary API events including OrderFilled fills, MMPTrigger notifications, and liquidation cancels delivered on the originating gateway.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"OrderFilled\",\"MMPTrigger\",\"unsolicited events\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Unsolicited Events\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to unsolicited events in Starbase Binary API including OrderFilled and MMPTrigger messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Unsolicited Events\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to unsolicited events in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/unsolicited-events\"}]},{\"group\":\"REST API\",\"expanded\":true,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"REST Order Gateway Authentication\",\"description\":\"Authenticate requests to the Starbase REST Order Gateway using HTTP Basic credentials, including API key handling and gateway session security.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"REST\",\"authentication\",\"Basic auth\",\"Authorization header\",\"clientId\",\"clientSecret\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase REST Order Gateway Authentication\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to authenticate to the Starbase REST Order Gateway using the Basic Authorization header scheme.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase REST Authentication\",\"twitter:description\":\"How to authenticate requests to the Starbase REST Order Gateway.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/rest-authentication\"},{\"title\":\"Get Open Orders\",\"description\":\"$79\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/private/get_open_orders\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/trading/get-open-orders\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Starbase Risk Limits\",\"description\":\"$7a\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/private/get_starbase_risk_limits\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/portfolio-management/get-starbase-risk-limits\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Mass Cancel\",\"description\":\"Cancels all open orders and quotes belonging to the authenticated portfolio. No filter parameters are accepted. The cancel applies to every instrument and every side.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/private/cancel_all\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/portfolio-management/mass-cancel\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Lock Portfolio\",\"description\":\"Locks the authenticated portfolio. All currently open `DIRECT_ACCESS` orders and quotes for this portfolio are cancelled immediately. New `DIRECT_ACCESS` orders and quotes are rejected until the portfolio is unlocked.\\n\\nREST-submitted orders are not affected by the lock state.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/private/lock_portfolio\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/portfolio-management/lock-portfolio\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Unlock Portfolio\",\"description\":\"Unlocks the authenticated portfolio, resuming normal acceptance of `DIRECT_ACCESS` orders and quotes.\\n\\nUnlocking the portfolio does **not** restore any previously cancelled orders.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/private/unlock_portfolio\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/portfolio-management/unlock-portfolio\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List Instruments\",\"description\":\"$7b\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/public/get_instruments\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/list-instruments\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"FIX Drop Copy\",\"expanded\":false,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Starbase FIX Drop Copy API\",\"description\":\"Starbase FIX Drop Copy delivers a per-Member feed of orders, trades, and executions, with reconciliation guidance for ID mapping, dedup, and gap replay.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"FIX drop copy\",\"FIX protocol\",\"execution reports\",\"trade capture\",\"drop copy\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase FIX Drop Copy API - Order and Trade Reporting\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to FIX Drop Copy API in Starbase for order and trade reporting via FIX protocol, including execution reports and trade capture.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase FIX Drop Copy API\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to FIX Drop Copy API for order and trade reporting in Starbase.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/fix-drop-copy-api\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"Core Concepts\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Market Model\",\"description\":\"The market model of Starbase is a subset of Deribit's market model. In Starbase, instruments are linked with Indices and Underlyings.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"market model\",\"AssetID\",\"underlying ID\",\"instrument states\",\"market states\",\"inverse\",\"linear\",\"instrument model\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Market Model - AssetID, Underlying ID, and Instrument States\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to the market model for Starbase API including AssetID, underlying ID, instrument states, and instrument pricing models.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Market Model\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to the market model for Starbase API including AssetID, underlying ID, and instrument states.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/market-model\"},{\"title\":\"Account Model\",\"description\":\"How the Starbase account and subaccount hierarchy differs from the Deribit main platform for order entry, drop copy, and permission scoping.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"account model\",\"portfolio\",\"member\",\"subaccount\",\"rate limits\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Account Model - Portfolio and Member\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to the account model for Starbase API including Portfolio and Member concepts and their relationship to subaccounts and rate limits.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Account Model\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to the account model for Starbase API including Portfolio and Member concepts.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/account-model\"},{\"title\":\"Underlying Tiers\",\"description\":\"Assets on Starbase are classified into three tiers based on liquidity. Tier assignments determine rate limits and multicast channel assignments.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"tiers\",\"underlying\",\"tier 1\",\"tier 2\",\"tier 3\",\"liquidity\",\"rate limits\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Underlying Tiers\",\"og:description\":\"Classification of Deribit underlyings into three tiers based on liquidity, aligned with Coinbase International Exchange tier assignments.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Underlying Tiers\",\"twitter:description\":\"Classification of Deribit underlyings into three tiers based on liquidity.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/underlying-tiers\"},{\"title\":\"Speed Bumps\",\"description\":\"Speed bumps in Starbase API for options trading, including how aggressive orders are delayed and how market makers are protected from latency arbitrage.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"speed bump\",\"options\",\"latency arbitrage\",\"market maker protection\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Speed Bumps\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to speed bumps in Starbase API for options trading, including how aggressive orders are delayed and market maker protection.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Speed Bumps\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to speed bumps in Starbase API for options trading.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/speed-bumps\"},{\"title\":\"Starbase Market Maker Protection (MMP)\",\"description\":\"Configure and reset Starbase Market Maker Protection thresholds, tag orders as MMP, and understand the per subaccount and base/quote pair MMP scope.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"MMP\",\"Market Maker Protection\",\"risk management\",\"ResetOrdersMmpRequest\",\"ResetMassQuoteMmpRequest\",\"ResetMmpResponse\",\"ResetMmpReject\",\"GetMassQuoteMmpStatusRequest\",\"GetOrdersMmpStatusRequest\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Binary API - Market Maker Protection (MMP)\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to Market Maker Protection (MMP) in Starbase Binary API including configuration, reset operations, and risk management.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Binary API - Market Maker Protection\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Market Maker Protection (MMP) in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/mmp\"},{\"title\":\"Self Match Prevention (SMP)\",\"description\":\"Prevent orders on the same member from matching each other. Configure Self Match Prevention groups and choose the cancel behavior policy.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"SMP\",\"Self Match Prevention\",\"matching engine\",\"order matching\",\"SMPToken\",\"member ID\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Self Match Prevention (SMP) - ME Functionality\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to Self Match Prevention (SMP) in Starbase API for preventing orders from matching with each other.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Self Match Prevention (SMP)\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Self Match Prevention (SMP) functionality in Starbase API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/smp\"},{\"title\":\"Portfolio Management\",\"description\":\"Portfolio-scoped Starbase controls for mass cancellation, direct-access order entry, and lock or unlock endpoints used in risk operations workflows.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"portfolio management\",\"lock portfolio\",\"unlock portfolio\",\"mass cancel\",\"cancel_all\",\"DIRECT_ACCESS\",\"risk management\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Portfolio Management\",\"og:description\":\"Portfolio-scoped controls for mass cancellation and direct-access order entry in Starbase.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Portfolio Management\",\"twitter:description\":\"Portfolio-scoped controls for mass cancellation and direct-access order entry in Starbase.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/portfolio-management\"}]},{\"group\":\"Technical Information\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Starbase API Rate Limits\",\"description\":\"Rate limiting rules for the Starbase order entry gateways. Covers per-subaccount key quotas, burst-equals-refill defaults, and gateway throttling behavior.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/api-rate-limits\"},{\"title\":\"Risk Bypass\",\"description\":\"How privileged Starbase sessions can bypass pre-trade risk checks for certain low-latency workflows. Covers configuration, scope, and eligibility requirements.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"risk bypass\",\"MMP\",\"Market Maker Protection\",\"risk engine\",\"low latency\",\"order entry\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Risk Bypass - Low-Latency Order Entry\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to risk bypass in Starbase, which allows MMP orders and quotes to bypass the risk engine for low-latency order entry.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Risk Bypass\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to risk bypass in Starbase for low-latency order entry.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/risk-bypass\"},{\"title\":\"Cancel on Disconnect\",\"description\":\"Automatically cancel working orders when a Starbase session drops. Enable Cancel on Disconnect, configure it, and combine it with heartbeats for safety.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Cancel on Disconnect\",\"CoD\",\"risk management\",\"gateway\",\"connection\",\"order cancellation\",\"SBE\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Cancel on Disconnect - Risk Management Feature\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to Cancel On Disconnect (CoD) in Starbase, a risk management feature that automatically cancels orders when gateway connections are lost.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Cancel on Disconnect\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Cancel On Disconnect (CoD) risk management feature in Starbase.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/cancel-on-disconnect\"},{\"title\":\"Gateway Connectivity\",\"description\":\"Starbase gateway endpoints, host lists, connection credentials, and network requirements for reaching the order entry and market data servers.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"gateway\",\"connectivity\",\"connections\",\"credentials\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Gateway Connectivity - Connection Information\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to gateway connectivity for Starbase API including gateway servers, connections, and credentials.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Gateway Connectivity\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to gateway connectivity and connection information for Starbase API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/gateway-connectivity\"},{\"title\":\"Multicast Channels\",\"description\":\"Starbase SBE Market Data Feed multicast channels over UDP. Channel assignments are sharded by product type, with A/B twins for redundancy and low latency.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"multicast\",\"market data\",\"order book feed\",\"snapshot\",\"incremental\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Channels - Market Data Distribution\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to multicast channels for market-by-order feeds in Starbase, including channel assignments by product type and A/B redundancy.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Channels\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to multicast channels for market data distribution in Starbase.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/multicast-channels\"},{\"title\":\"Multicast Subscription Guide\",\"description\":\"Step-by-step procedure to subscribe and unsubscribe from Starbase UDP multicast market data feeds, including channel discovery and IGMP setup.\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"multicast\",\"subscription\",\"IGMPv3\",\"PIM\",\"BGP\",\"colo\",\"multicast group\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Subscription Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Step-by-step guide for subscribing to and unsubscribing from Starbase Multicast feeds, covering both Colo and Cross-Connect customers.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Subscription Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Steps for subscribing to and unsubscribing from Starbase Multicast feeds.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/multicast-subscription-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Multicast Retransmit Gateway\",\"description\":\"Recover missed Starbase multicast messages via the UDP unicast retransmit service. Request ranges by sequence number to fill incremental feed gaps.\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"multicast\",\"retransmit\",\"gap fill\",\"SBE\",\"UDP unicast\",\"sequence number\",\"rate limiting\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Retransmit Gateway\",\"og:description\":\"Complete reference for the Starbase retransmit gateway: wire protocol, SBE message formats, cache behavior, rate limiting, and client implementation guidance.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Retransmit Gateway\",\"twitter:description\":\"Wire protocol and implementation guide for recovering missed multicast messages via the Starbase retransmit gateway.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/retransmit-gateway\"}]}]}]},{\"tab\":\"Changelogs\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Changelogs\",\"href\":\"/changelogs/jsonrpc\"}]}]},{\"version\":\"Upcoming\",\"tabs\":[{\"tab\":\"Overview\",\"groups\":[{\"group\":\"Introduction\",\"expanded\":false,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Welcome to Deribit API\",\"description\":\"Deribit is a crypto derivatives exchange offering futures, options, and perpetuals. This documentation is your integration entry point for the API.\",\"keywords\":[\"Deribit API\",\"cryptocurrency API\",\"derivatives trading\",\"Bitcoin futures\",\"options trading\",\"WebSocket API\",\"FIX API\",\"trading API\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API Documentation - Cryptocurrency Derivatives Trading API\",\"og:description\":\"Complete API documentation for Deribit cryptocurrency derivatives exchange. Integrate with JSON-RPC, WebSocket, and FIX APIs for trading futures, perpetuals, and options.\",\"og:type\":\"website\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API Documentation\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete API documentation for Deribit cryptocurrency derivatives exchange. Integrate with JSON-RPC, WebSocket, and FIX APIs.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Quickstart Guide\",\"description\":\"Set up the Deribit API environment, send your first authenticated JSON-RPC request, and use the key endpoints to place an order in minutes.\",\"keywords\":[\"Deribit quickstart\",\"API tutorial\",\"get started\",\"first API call\",\"Deribit integration\",\"API setup\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API Quickstart Guide - Get Started in Minutes\",\"og:description\":\"Get started with Deribit API in minutes. Learn how to create API keys, authenticate, and make your first API calls with step-by-step examples.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API Quickstart Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Get started with Deribit API in minutes. Step-by-step guide to creating API keys, authenticating, and making your first API calls.\",\"href\":\"/articles/deribit-quickstart\"}]},{\"group\":\"Authentication\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Creating new API key\",\"description\":\"Generate a new Deribit API key from the web interface or programmatically, including choosing scopes, IP restrictions, and secret handling tips.\",\"keywords\":[\"API key creation\",\"create API key\",\"API credentials\",\"client ID\",\"client secret\",\"API setup\",\"API configuration\"],\"og:title\":\"Creating Deribit API Keys - Frontend and API Methods\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to create Deribit API keys using the web interface or API. Configure scopes, IP whitelisting, and security settings.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Creating Deribit API Keys Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Step-by-step guide to creating Deribit API keys via web interface or API, including scope configuration and security settings.\",\"href\":\"/articles/creating-api-key\"},{\"title\":\"Authentication\",\"description\":\"OAuth 2.0-style authentication for private Deribit API requests, covering access tokens, refresh tokens, scopes, and signature-based login flows.\",\"keywords\":[\"Deribit authentication\",\"OAuth 2.0\",\"API keys\",\"access token\",\"refresh token\",\"client credentials\",\"client signature\",\"API security\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API Authentication Guide - OAuth 2.0 and API Keys\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to authenticate with Deribit API using OAuth 2.0, manage API keys, handle access tokens, and implement secure authentication flows.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API Authentication Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Deribit API authentication including OAuth 2.0, API keys, tokens, and security best practices.\",\"href\":\"/articles/authentication\"},{\"title\":\"Access Scope\",\"description\":\"OAuth scope controls read and write access for Deribit API tokens, letting you set granular permission levels for account, trade, and wallet actions.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"API scopes\",\"access scopes\",\"API permissions\",\"OAuth scopes\",\"API authorization\",\"permission levels\",\"read write access\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API Access Scopes - Permission and Authorization Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Learn about Deribit API access scopes, permission levels, connection vs session scopes, and how to configure read-only or read-write access for your API keys.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API Access Scopes Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Deribit API access scopes, permissions, and authorization levels for API keys.\",\"href\":\"/articles/access-scope\"},{\"title\":\"Security Keys\",\"description\":\"Hardware security keys and additional signing requirements for sensitive Deribit API methods like withdrawals, key management, and Travel Rule data.\",\"keywords\":[\"security keys\",\"2FA\",\"two-factor authentication\",\"TOTP\",\"API security\",\"authorization\",\"security confirmation\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API Security Keys - Two-Factor Authentication Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to use Security Keys and Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) with Deribit API for secure withdrawals, API key management, and sensitive operations.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API Security Keys Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to using Security Keys and 2FA with Deribit API for enhanced security on sensitive operations.\",\"href\":\"/articles/security-keys\"}]},{\"group\":\"Technical Information\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"API Usage Policy\",\"description\":\"Deribit fair-use API policy outlines acceptable traffic patterns, throttling rules, and consequences of abuse to keep exchange infrastructure healthy.\",\"keywords\":[\"API usage policy\",\"OTV ratio\",\"order to volume\",\"API guidelines\",\"rate limiting\",\"API best practices\",\"matching engine\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API Usage Policy - Guidelines and Best Practices\",\"og:description\":\"Deribit API usage policy including Order to Volume (OTV) ratios, matching engine guidelines, and best practices for efficient API usage.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API Usage Policy\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete Deribit API usage policy with OTV ratios, matching engine guidelines, and API best practices.\",\"href\":\"/articles/api-usage-policy\"},{\"title\":\"Rate Limits\",\"description\":\"How credit-based rate limiting works on the Deribit API, including burst and sustained caps, matching engine limits, and per-tier request quotas.\",\"keywords\":[\"rate limits\",\"API rate limiting\",\"credit system\",\"throttling\",\"API quotas\",\"request limits\",\"matching engine\",\"non-matching engine\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API Rate Limits - Credit-Based Rate Limiting System\",\"og:description\":\"Understand Deribit's credit-based rate limiting system, matching vs non-matching engine limits, tier-based limits, and how to optimize API usage.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API Rate Limits Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Deribit's credit-based rate limiting system, tier limits, and API usage optimization.\",\"href\":\"/articles/rate-limits\"}]},{\"group\":\"Best Practices\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Connection Management\",\"description\":\"Best practices for Deribit WebSocket connection lifecycle including heartbeats, session versus connection tokens, and reliable reconnect strategies.\",\"keywords\":[\"connection management\",\"WebSocket connections\",\"session management\",\"connection limits\",\"API connections\",\"connection scopes\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API Connection Management - Best Practices Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Learn best practices for managing Deribit API connections, WebSocket sessions, connection limits, and optimizing connection scopes for reliable API access.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API Connection Management Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Best practices for managing Deribit API connections, WebSocket sessions, and connection limits.\",\"href\":\"/articles/connection-management-best-practices\"},{\"title\":\"Market Data Collection\",\"description\":\"Efficient Deribit market data ingestion patterns covering snapshots, incremental updates, throttling, and channel selection per instrument.\",\"keywords\":[\"market data\",\"real-time data\",\"WebSocket subscriptions\",\"FIX market data\",\"order book updates\",\"data collection\",\"algorithmic trading\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Market Data Collection Best Practices - Real-Time Data Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Learn best practices for efficient market data collection on Deribit including WebSocket subscriptions, FIX feeds, raw vs aggregated data, and latency optimization.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Market Data Collection Best Practices\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to efficient market data collection and real-time data consumption on Deribit API.\",\"href\":\"/articles/market-data-collection-best-practices\"},{\"title\":\"Options Data Collection\",\"description\":\"Collect Deribit options market data efficiently, covering order books, ticker greeks, mark prices, implied volatility, combos, trades, and settlement data.\",\"keywords\":[\"options data\",\"options market data\",\"Deribit options\",\"greeks\",\"implied volatility\",\"mark price\",\"order book depth\",\"options collection\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Options Data Collection - Best Practices Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Learn best practices for collecting Deribit options market data, including order books, greeks, mark price/IV, trades, combos, and settlement data.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Options Data Collection Best Practices\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to collecting options market data from the Deribit API: order books, greeks, IV, trades, combos, and settlement.\",\"href\":\"/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices\"},{\"title\":\"Order Management\",\"description\":\"High-performance order management on Deribit, covering batching, cancel and replace flows, label usage, and how to avoid rate-limit throttling under load.\",\"keywords\":[\"order management\",\"trading best practices\",\"order execution\",\"latency optimization\",\"order cancellation\",\"advanced orders\",\"OCO\",\"OTO\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Order Management Best Practices - High-Performance Trading Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Learn best practices for efficient order management on Deribit including order submission, latency optimization, cancellation strategies, and advanced order types.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Order Management Best Practices\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to order management best practices for high-performance trading on Deribit API.\",\"href\":\"/articles/order-management-best-practices\"},{\"title\":\"Using the currency Parameter\",\"description\":\"Discover supported currencies with get_currencies, learn what currency selects on each Deribit method, and avoid invalid currency and spot routing errors.\",\"keywords\":[\"currency parameter\",\"settlement currency\",\"wallet currency\",\"supported currencies\",\"get_currencies\",\"invalid currency\",\"get_positions currency\",\"spot currency\",\"currency any\"],\"og:title\":\"Using the currency Parameter - Deribit API Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Choose the correct currency value for each Deribit API method, discover supported currencies at runtime, and avoid invalid currency and routed spot errors.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API currency Parameter Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"How to use the currency parameter correctly across positions, wallet and market data methods on the Deribit API.\",\"href\":\"/articles/currency-parameter\"}]},{\"group\":\"Guides\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Managing Deposits\",\"description\":\"Generate deposit addresses, check deposit status and history, and submit Travel Rule originator information using the Deribit deposit API endpoints.\",\"keywords\":[\"deposits API\",\"deposit addresses\",\"deposit history\",\"Travel Rule\",\"crypto deposits\",\"wallet API\",\"deposit management\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Deposits API - Managing Deposit Addresses and History\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to generate deposit addresses, check deposit history, and submit Travel Rule information using Deribit's deposits API.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Deposits API Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to managing deposits, generating addresses, and checking deposit history with Deribit API.\",\"href\":\"/articles/managing-deposits-api\"},{\"title\":\"Managing Transfers\",\"description\":\"Transfer funds between the main account and subaccounts or to other Deribit users using the API, including two-step confirmation flows for security.\",\"keywords\":[\"transfers API\",\"subaccount transfers\",\"account transfers\",\"wallet transfers\",\"transfer between accounts\",\"API transfers\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Transfers API - Transfer Funds Between Accounts\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to perform transfers between main accounts and subaccounts using Deribit's transfers API, including authentication and transfer methods.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Transfers API Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to transferring funds between main accounts and subaccounts using Deribit API.\",\"href\":\"/articles/managing-transfers-api\"},{\"title\":\"Managing Subaccounts\",\"description\":\"Create, rename, configure permissions, and manage D