e\",\"wallet API\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Coinbase Wallet API - Multi-Network Deposits and Withdrawals\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how network selection, address book entries, Travel Rule data and withdrawals work on the Deribit wallet API for Coinbase-custodied accounts.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Coinbase Wallet API Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Network selection, address book entries, CTN counterparties and withdrawals for Coinbase-custodied Deribit accounts.\",\"href\":\"/articles/coinbase-wallet-api\"},{\"title\":\"Moving Positions\",\"description\":\"Transfer open positions between Deribit subaccounts using the API, including required permissions, valuation, and settlement of moved contracts.\",\"keywords\":[\"position moves\",\"move positions\",\"subaccount positions\",\"position transfer\",\"position management\",\"portfolio management\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Moving Positions API - Transfer Positions Between Subaccounts\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to move positions between subaccounts within the same main account using Deribit's position moving API.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Moving Positions API Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to moving positions between subaccounts using Deribit API.\",\"href\":\"/articles/moving-positions-api\"},{\"title\":\"Block Trading\",\"description\":\"Negotiate and execute block trades between two counterparties on Deribit via API, including quote verification, approval, and settlement workflows.\",\"keywords\":[\"block trading\",\"block trades\",\"institutional trading\",\"large trades\",\"off-book trading\",\"negotiated trades\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Block Trading API - Execute Large Off-Book Trades\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to execute block trades between two parties using Deribit's block trading API for large institutional trades off the public order book.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Block Trading API Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to executing block trades between parties using Deribit API for institutional trading.\",\"href\":\"/articles/block-trading-api\"},{\"title\":\"Voice Broker Trading API\",\"description\":\"How voice brokers submit block trades for clients on Deribit and how clients approve, reject, and monitor those trades via API endpoints and events.\",\"keywords\":[\"voice broker\",\"broker trading\",\"block trade\",\"broker client\",\"trade confirmation\",\"institutional trading\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Voice Broker Trading API\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how voice brokers execute block trades on behalf of clients and how clients approve, reject, and monitor broker-executed trades via the Deribit API.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Voice Broker Trading API Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to voice broker trading on Deribit, covering how to execute block trades on behalf of clients and manage trade confirmations via the API.\",\"href\":\"/articles/voice-broker-trading-api\"},{\"title\":\"Asymmetric API Keys\",\"description\":\"Asymmetric API keys use public and private key pairs to sign Deribit requests, offering stronger authentication and reduced credential exposure risk.\",\"keywords\":[\"asymmetric API keys\",\"Ed25519\",\"RSA keys\",\"public private key\",\"cryptographic signatures\",\"API security\",\"key pairs\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Asymmetric API Keys - Enhanced Security with Public-Private Key Pairs\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to use asymmetric API keys (Ed25519 or RSA) with Deribit API for enhanced security. Generate key pairs, sign requests, and improve API security.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Asymmetric API Keys Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to using asymmetric API keys (Ed25519/RSA) with Deribit API for enhanced cryptographic security.\",\"href\":\"/articles/asymmetric-api-keys\"},{\"title\":\"Market Maker Protection (MMP) API Configuration\",\"description\":\"Configure MMP thresholds, freeze times, and reset behavior for market maker order flow on Deribit via API to guard against toxic fills and runaways.\",\"keywords\":[\"MMP\",\"Market Maker Protection\",\"risk management\",\"quote protection\",\"exposure limits\",\"trading risk\",\"MMP configuration\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Market Maker Protection (MMP) API Configuration Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to configure and manage Market Maker Protection (MMP) settings using Deribit API to reduce exposure risk and protect quoting activity.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Market Maker Protection API Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to configuring Market Maker Protection (MMP) settings with Deribit API for risk management.\",\"href\":\"/articles/market-maker-protection\"},{\"title\":\"Liquidity Support Program (LSP) API Guide\",\"description\":\"Deribit's Liquidity Support Program (LSP) transfers liquidated positions to designated participant accounts before falling back to auto-deleveraging (ADL).\",\"keywords\":[\"LSP\",\"Liquidity Support Program\",\"liquidation\",\"auto-deleveraging\",\"ADL\",\"risk management\",\"cooldown group\",\"reduce-only\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Liquidity Support Program (LSP) API Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how Deribit's Liquidity Support Program (LSP) works, how to monitor LSP participation via the API, and what to expect if your position is liquidated or auto-deleveraged.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Liquidity Support Program API Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Deribit's Liquidity Support Program (LSP): eligibility, cooldown groups, transfer pricing, and API monitoring.\",\"href\":\"/articles/lsp-api-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Accessing Historical Trades and Orders Using API\",\"description\":\"Use the historical parameter on Deribit API endpoints to retrieve past trades and orders beyond the default lookback window for backfills and audits.\",\"keywords\":[\"historical data\",\"historical trades\",\"historical orders\",\"trade history\",\"order history\",\"historical API\",\"data retrieval\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Historical Trades and Orders API - Access Historical Data\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to retrieve historical trade and order records using Deribit API, including retention periods and supported endpoints.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Historical Data API Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to accessing historical trades and orders using Deribit API with retention period information.\",\"href\":\"/articles/accessing-historical-trades-orders\"},{\"title\":\"Deribit Block RFQ API Walkthrough\",\"description\":\"Step-by-step Block RFQ API walkthrough for requesting quotes on large block trades from Deribit market makers and executing multi-leg strategies.\",\"keywords\":[\"Block RFQ\",\"Request for Quote\",\"block trading\",\"market makers\",\"institutional trading\",\"RFQ API\",\"quote requests\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Block RFQ API Walkthrough - Request Quotes for Large Block Trades\",\"og:description\":\"Complete walkthrough of Deribit's Block RFQ API for requesting quotes from market makers, managing RFQs, and executing large block trades.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Block RFQ API Walkthrough\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to using Deribit's Block RFQ API for requesting quotes and executing large block trades.\",\"href\":\"/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough\"},{\"title\":\"Mass Quotes Specifications\",\"description\":\"Use the Deribit mass quote API to submit many bid and ask pairs in a single request for lower latency during option and future market making.\",\"keywords\":[\"mass quotes\",\"multiple orders\",\"quote API\",\"low latency\",\"MMP groups\",\"market making\",\"quote management\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Mass Quotes Specifications - Low-Latency Order Placement\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to use Deribit's mass quote functionality to place multiple orders in a single request with reduced latency and Market Maker Protection groups.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Mass Quotes Specifications\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Deribit's mass quote functionality for low-latency multiple order placement.\",\"href\":\"/articles/mass-quotes-specifications\"},{\"title\":\"Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments\",\"description\":\"Which Deribit spot instruments are matched on Deribit and which are routed to Coinbase Exchange, and how order entry and market data differ between them.\",\"keywords\":[\"spot instruments\",\"spot trading\",\"Coinbase routed spot\",\"CBE routed\",\"is_cbe_routed\",\"is_csr\",\"trade tape\",\"spot order types\",\"FIX spot trading\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API - Spot Trading on Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments\",\"og:description\":\"Which spot instruments are matched on Deribit and which are routed to Coinbase Exchange, and how the API differs between the two.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API - Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Spot Trading\",\"twitter:description\":\"Order entry and market data differences between Deribit-matched and Coinbase-routed spot instruments.\",\"href\":\"/articles/spot-trading-venues\"},{\"title\":\"Coinbase International Exchange API Migration\",\"description\":\"How International Exchange API and FIX integrations connect to Deribit after the migration: keys, endpoints, instruments, orders, and positions.\",\"keywords\":[\"INTX migration\",\"Coinbase International Exchange\",\"Deribit API\",\"BTC_USDC-PERPETUAL\",\"API migration\",\"FIX migration\"],\"og:title\":\"Coinbase International Exchange API Migration - Deribit\",\"og:description\":\"Keys, endpoints, instrument names, and order attributes for International Exchange API and FIX integrations on Deribit.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Coinbase International Exchange API Migration\",\"twitter:description\":\"Endpoints, keys, instrument names, and order attributes for International Exchange integrations on Deribit.\",\"href\":\"/articles/intx-api-migration\"}]}]},{\"tab\":\"API Reference\",\"dropdowns\":[{\"dropdown\":\"JSON-RPC API\",\"icon\":\"code\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"Methods overview\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"JSON-RPC 2.0 Protocol\",\"description\":\"Deribit API uses JSON-RPC 2.0 for all API communications. This standardized protocol provides a simple and consistent way to make remote procedure calls.\",\"keywords\":[\"JSON-RPC 2.0\",\"RPC protocol\",\"API protocol\",\"WebSocket\",\"HTTP REST\",\"API requests\",\"remote procedure calls\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit JSON-RPC 2.0 Protocol Documentation\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to Deribit's JSON-RPC 2.0 API protocol. Learn request/response formats, WebSocket and HTTP transport, error handling, and best practices.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit JSON-RPC 2.0 Protocol Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Deribit's JSON-RPC 2.0 API protocol including request formats, WebSocket, HTTP, and error handling.\",\"href\":\"/articles/json-rpc-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Error Codes\",\"description\":\"Complete reference of Deribit API error codes, HTTP status meanings, and guidance on handling common failure scenarios in production client code.\",\"keywords\":[\"API errors\",\"error codes\",\"error handling\",\"API troubleshooting\",\"error reference\",\"API debugging\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API Error Codes Reference - Complete Error Handling Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Complete reference guide for all Deribit API error codes. Learn error handling strategies, retry logic, and troubleshooting techniques.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API Error Codes Reference\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete reference for all Deribit API error codes with handling strategies and troubleshooting guides.\",\"href\":\"/articles/errors\"},{\"title\":\"Using the currency Parameter\",\"description\":\"Discover supported currencies with get_currencies, learn what currency selects on each Deribit method, and avoid invalid currency and spot routing errors.\",\"keywords\":[\"currency parameter\",\"settlement currency\",\"wallet currency\",\"supported currencies\",\"get_currencies\",\"invalid currency\",\"get_positions currency\",\"spot currency\",\"currency any\"],\"og:title\":\"Using the currency Parameter - Deribit API Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Choose the correct currency value for each Deribit API method, discover supported currencies at runtime, and avoid invalid currency and routed spot errors.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API currency Parameter Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"How to use the currency parameter correctly across positions, wallet and market data methods on the Deribit API.\",\"href\":\"/articles/currency-parameter\"}]},{\"group\":\"Methods\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"Authentication\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"public/auth\",\"description\":\"$7c\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/auth\",\"keywords\":[\"public/auth\",\"grant_type\",\"client_id\",\"client_secret\",\"refresh_token\",\"timestamp\",\"signature\",\"nonce\",\"data\",\"state\",\"scope\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/auth\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/authentication/public-auth\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/exchange_token\",\"description\":\"Generates a token for a new subject id. This method can be used to switch between subaccounts.\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Fork and Exchange Tokens](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/authentication#fork-and-exchange-tokens)\\n- [Managing Subaccounts](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-subaccounts-api)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fexchange_token)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/exchange_token\",\"keywords\":[\"public/exchange_token\",\"refresh_token\",\"subject_id\",\"scope\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/exchange_token\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/authentication/public-exchange_token\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/fork_token\",\"description\":\"Generates a token for a new named session. This method can be used only with session scoped tokens.\\n\\n**📖 More Details:** [Fork and Exchange Tokens](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/authentication#fork-and-exchange-tokens)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Ffork_token)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/fork_token\",\"keywords\":[\"public/fork_token\",\"refresh_token\",\"session_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/fork_token\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/authentication/public-fork_token\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/logout\",\"description\":\"$7d\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/logout\",\"keywords\":[\"private/logout\",\"invalidate_token\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/logout\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/authentication/private-logout\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Account Management\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"private/change_api_key_name\",\"description\":\"Updates the display name for an API key. The name is used for identification purposes in the API key list and does not affect the key's functionality or permissions.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Creating new API key on Deribit](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/creating-api-key)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fchange_api_key_name)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/change_api_key_name\",\"keywords\":[\"private/change_api_key_name\",\"id\",\"name\",\"timestamp\",\"client_id\",\"client_secret\",\"public_key\",\"max_scope\",\"enabled\",\"default\",\"enabled_features\",\"ip_whitelist\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/change_api_key_name\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-change_api_key_name\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/change_margin_model\",\"description\":\"Changes the margin model for the authenticated account or a specified subaccount. Margin models determine how margin requirements are calculated (e.g., Standard Margin vs. Portfolio Margin).\\n\\nChanging the margin model may affect margin requirements, available funds, and trading capabilities. Use the `dry_run` parameter to preview the impact of the change before applying it.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Margin types and usage](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/25944811317149-Margin-types-and-usage)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fchange_margin_model)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/change_margin_model\",\"keywords\":[\"private/change_margin_model\",\"user_id\",\"margin_model\",\"dry_run\",\"old_state\",\"new_state\",\"currency\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/change_margin_model\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-change_margin_model\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/change_scope_in_api_key\",\"description\":\"Updates the scope (permissions) for an existing API key. The scope determines which operations the API key can perform (e.g., read-only, read-write, trading, etc.).\\n\\nWhen the scope is changed, the API key immediately loses access to operations outside the new scope. Applications using this key may need to be updated to reflect the new permissions.\\n\\n**[TFA required](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/security-keys)**\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Creating new API key on Deribit](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/creating-api-key)\\n- [Access Scope](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/access-scope)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fchange_scope_in_api_key)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/change_scope_in_api_key\",\"keywords\":[\"private/change_scope_in_api_key\",\"max_scope\",\"id\",\"timestamp\",\"client_id\",\"client_secret\",\"public_key\",\"enabled\",\"default\",\"name\",\"enabled_features\",\"ip_whitelist\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/change_scope_in_api_key\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-change_scope_in_api_key\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/change_subaccount_name\",\"description\":\"Updates the display name (username) for a subaccount. The new name is used for identification purposes and does not affect the subaccount's functionality or access.\\n\\nOnly the main account owner can change subaccount names.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Subaccounts](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-subaccounts-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write` and mainaccount\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fchange_subaccount_name)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/change_subaccount_name\",\"keywords\":[\"private/change_subaccount_name\",\"sid\",\"name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/change_subaccount_name\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-change_subaccount_name\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/create_api_key\",\"description\":\"Creates a new API key with the specified scope and permissions. API keys are used for programmatic access to the Deribit API and can be restricted to specific operations and IP addresses.\\n\\nThe response includes both the API key ID and the secret key. Store the secret securely as it will not be displayed again. You can view the API key details (without the secret) using the `list_api_keys` method.\\n\\n**Note:** The new API key cannot be granted higher scopes than the API key used for authentication. Attempting to assign a scope that exceeds the authenticating key's permissions will result in an error.\\n\\n**[TFA required](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/security-keys)**\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Creating new API key on Deribit](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/creating-api-key)\\n- [Access Scope](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/access-scope)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcreate_api_key)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/create_api_key\",\"keywords\":[\"private/create_api_key\",\"max_scope\",\"name\",\"public_key\",\"enabled_features\",\"timestamp\",\"client_id\",\"client_secret\",\"enabled\",\"default\",\"ip_whitelist\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/create_api_key\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-create_api_key\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/create_subaccount\",\"description\":\"Creates a new subaccount under the authenticated main account. Subaccounts allow you to organize trading activities and manage risk separately from the main account.\\n\\nThis method takes no parameters. The new subaccount will be created with default settings and can be configured using other subaccount management methods.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Subaccounts](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-subaccounts-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write` and mainaccount\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcreate_subaccount)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/create_subaccount\",\"keywords\":[\"private/create_subaccount\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/create_subaccount\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-create_subaccount\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/delete_member\",\"description\":\"Deletes a Direct Access member from the account. Returns the resulting list of all members\\nconfigured for the account.\\n\\nThis method is dedicated to Starbase. See [Starbase Account Model](https://docs.deribit.com/starbase/account-model)\\nfor an explanation of Members, portfolios, and their relationship to Deribit accounts.\\n\\nRequires Direct Access trading to be enabled for the account.\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write` and mainaccount\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fdelete_member)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/delete_member\",\"keywords\":[\"private/delete_member\",\"member_id\",\"members\",\"is_direct_access_allowed\",\"main_uid\",\"name\",\"is_active\",\"accounts\",\"m_tstamp\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/delete_member\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-delete_member\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/disable_api_key\",\"description\":\"Disables an API key, preventing it from being used to authenticate API requests. The key remains in your account but cannot be used until it is re-enabled.\\n\\nThis is useful for temporarily suspending access without permanently deleting the key. All requests using this key will be rejected until it is enabled again.\\n\\n**[TFA required](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/security-keys)**\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Creating new API key on Deribit](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/creating-api-key)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fdisable_api_key)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/disable_api_key\",\"keywords\":[\"private/disable_api_key\",\"id\",\"timestamp\",\"client_id\",\"client_secret\",\"public_key\",\"max_scope\",\"enabled\",\"default\",\"name\",\"enabled_features\",\"ip_whitelist\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/disable_api_key\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-disable_api_key\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/edit_api_key\",\"description\":\"Updates properties of an existing API key. You can modify the key name, scope, enabled status, features, and IP whitelist. At least one parameter must be provided.\\n\\nChanges take effect immediately. If you modify the scope, the API key will only have access to the newly specified permissions.\\n\\n**[TFA required](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/security-keys)**\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Creating new API key on Deribit](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/creating-api-key)\\n- [Access Scope](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/access-scope)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fedit_api_key)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/edit_api_key\",\"keywords\":[\"private/edit_api_key\",\"id\",\"max_scope\",\"name\",\"enabled\",\"enabled_features\",\"ip_whitelist\",\"timestamp\",\"client_id\",\"client_secret\",\"public_key\",\"default\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/edit_api_key\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-edit_api_key\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/enable_affiliate_program\",\"description\":\"Enables the affiliate program for the authenticated account. Once enabled, you can earn commissions by referring new users to Deribit.\\n\\nAfter enabling, you will receive a unique affiliate link that can be shared with potential users. Commissions are paid based on the trading activity of referred users.\\n\\n**📖 Related Support Article:** [Affiliate Program](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/25944777728797-Affiliate-Program)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fenable_affiliate_program)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/enable_affiliate_program\",\"keywords\":[\"private/enable_affiliate_program\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/enable_affiliate_program\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-enable_affiliate_program\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/enable_api_key\",\"description\":\"Enables a previously disabled API key, restoring its ability to authenticate API requests. The API key can be used immediately after being enabled.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Creating new API key on Deribit](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/creating-api-key)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fenable_api_key)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/enable_api_key\",\"keywords\":[\"private/enable_api_key\",\"id\",\"timestamp\",\"client_id\",\"client_secret\",\"public_key\",\"max_scope\",\"enabled\",\"default\",\"name\",\"enabled_features\",\"ip_whitelist\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/enable_api_key\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-enable_api_key\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_access_log\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a log of API access attempts and authentication events for the authenticated account. The log includes information such as IP addresses, timestamps, API methods called, and authentication status.\\n\\nUse this method to monitor account security, review API usage patterns, and identify unauthorized access attempts. Results can be paginated using the `offset` and `count` parameters.\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_access_log)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_access_log\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_access_log\",\"offset\",\"count\",\"ip\",\"timestamp\",\"country\",\"city\",\"log\",\"data\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_access_log\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_access_log\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_account_summaries\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a per-currency list of account summaries for the authenticated user. Each summary includes balance, equity, available funds, and margin information for each currency.\\n\\nTo retrieve summaries for a specific subaccount, use the `subaccount_id` parameter. When the `extended` parameter is set to `true`, additional account details such as account ID, username, email, and account type are included. Prefer this method over looping `private/get_account_summary` per currency.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Using the currency Parameter](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/currency-parameter)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_account_summaries)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_account_summaries\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_account_summaries\",\"subaccount_id\",\"extended\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_account_summaries\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_account_summaries\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_account_summary\",\"description\":\"$7e\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_account_summary\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_account_summary\",\"currency\",\"subaccount_id\",\"extended\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_account_summary\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_account_summary\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_affiliate_program_info\",\"description\":\"Retrieves information about the affiliate program status for the authenticated account. The response includes the number of referred affiliates, total payouts earned, pending payouts, and the unique affiliate referral link.\\n\\nUse this method to track your affiliate program performance and earnings.\\n\\n**📖 Related Support Article:** [Affiliate Program](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/25944777728797-Affiliate-Program)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_affiliate_program_info)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_affiliate_program_info\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_affiliate_program_info\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_affiliate_program_info\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_affiliate_program_info\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_currencies\",\"description\":\"Returns a list of cryptocurrencies available for the authenticated user's account.\\n\\nThis method takes no parameters. Drive wallet and balance requests from this list rather than hardcoding currencies or using `public/get_currencies`.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Using the currency Parameter](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/currency-parameter)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_currencies)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_currencies\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_currencies\",\"currency\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_currencies\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_currencies\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_email_language\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the currently configured language preference for email notifications. Returns the language code (e.g., `en`, `ko`, `zh`, `ja`, `ru`) that is used for all email communications sent to the account.\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_email_language)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_email_language\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_email_language\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_email_language\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_email_language\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_members\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the list of Direct Access members configured for the account. A member represents an\\nexternal identity (e.g. a FIX or Direct Access order gateway user) that can be granted Direct\\nAccess trading rights on the account or one of its subaccounts.\\n\\nThis method is dedicated to Starbase. See [Starbase Account Model](https://docs.deribit.com/starbase/account-model)\\nfor an explanation of Members, portfolios, and their relationship to Deribit accounts.\\n\\nWhen called from a subaccount, only members whose `accounts` include that subaccount are\\nreturned, and only the `name` and `is_active` fields are included for each of them.\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_members)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_members\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_members\",\"members\",\"is_direct_access_allowed\",\"member_id\",\"main_uid\",\"name\",\"is_active\",\"accounts\",\"m_tstamp\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_members\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_members\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_new_announcements\",\"description\":\"Retrieves only unread announcements for the authenticated account. Announcements are marked as read when you use the `set_announcement_as_read` method or view them through the web interface.\\n\\nThis method is useful for displaying notification badges or highlighting new announcements that require the user's attention.\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_new_announcements)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_new_announcements\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_new_announcements\",\"body\",\"publication_timestamp\",\"important\",\"confirmation\",\"title\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_new_announcements\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_new_announcements\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_position\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the open position for a specific instrument. Returns detailed position information including size, average entry price, mark price, unrealized P\u0026L, initial margin, maintenance margin, and other position-related metrics.\\n\\nIf no position exists for the specified instrument, the response will indicate a zero position.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_position)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_position\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_position\",\"instrument_name\",\"kind\",\"user_id\",\"average_price\",\"direction\",\"mark_price\",\"delta\",\"gamma\",\"vega\",\"theta\",\"index_price\",\"initial_margin\",\"maintenance_margin\",\"settlement_price\",\"total_profit_loss\",\"floating_profit_loss\",\"realized_profit_loss\",\"size\",\"size_currency\",\"average_price_usd\",\"floating_profit_loss_usd\",\"leverage\",\"realized_funding\",\"interest_value\",\"estimated_liquidation_price\",\"open_orders_margin\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_position\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_position\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_positions\",\"description\":\"Retrieves all open positions for the authenticated account. Returns position details including size, average entry price, mark price, unrealized P\u0026L, initial margin, maintenance margin, and other position-related information.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by currency and instrument kind (future, option, etc.). To retrieve positions for a specific subaccount, use the `subaccount_id` parameter. Spot holdings are balances, not positions — `kind: \\\"spot\\\"` is rejected. Prefer `currency: \\\"any\\\"` over looping currencies.\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Using the currency Parameter](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/currency-parameter)\\n- [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_positions)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_positions\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_positions\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"subaccount_id\",\"instrument_name\",\"user_id\",\"average_price\",\"direction\",\"mark_price\",\"delta\",\"gamma\",\"vega\",\"theta\",\"index_price\",\"initial_margin\",\"maintenance_margin\",\"settlement_price\",\"total_profit_loss\",\"floating_profit_loss\",\"realized_profit_loss\",\"size\",\"size_currency\",\"average_price_usd\",\"floating_profit_loss_usd\",\"leverage\",\"realized_funding\",\"interest_value\",\"estimated_liquidation_price\",\"open_orders_margin\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_positions\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_positions\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_subaccounts\",\"description\":\"Retrieves information about all subaccounts associated with the main account. Returns details such as subaccount IDs, names, and status.\\n\\nWhen called from a subaccount, the response includes limited details for the main account and full details for the subaccount initiating the request.\\n\\nSet the `with_portfolio` parameter to `true` to include portfolio information (balances, positions, etc.) in the response. By default, only subaccount metadata is returned.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Subaccounts](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-subaccounts-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_subaccounts)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_subaccounts\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_subaccounts\",\"with_portfolio\",\"username\",\"type\",\"email\",\"not_confirmed_email\",\"security_keys_enabled\",\"security_keys_assignments\",\"system_name\",\"receive_notifications\",\"is_password\",\"margin_model\",\"proof_id\",\"proof_id_signature\",\"login_enabled\",\"portfolio\",\"btc(example)\",\"margin_balance\",\"currency\",\"maintenance_margin\",\"initial_margin\",\"equity\",\"balance\",\"available_withdrawal_funds\",\"available_funds\",\"additional_reserve\",\"spot_reserve\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_subaccounts\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_subaccounts\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_subaccounts_details\",\"description\":\"Retrieves position details for all subaccounts for a specific currency. Returns positions aggregated across all subaccounts, including size, average entry price, mark price, and P\u0026L information.\\n\\nOptionally include open orders for each subaccount by setting the `with_open_orders` parameter to `true`.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Subaccounts](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-subaccounts-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_subaccounts_details)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_subaccounts_details\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_subaccounts_details\",\"currency\",\"with_open_orders\",\"uid\",\"positions\",\"open_orders\",\"instrument_name\",\"kind\",\"user_id\",\"average_price\",\"direction\",\"mark_price\",\"delta\",\"gamma\",\"vega\",\"theta\",\"index_price\",\"initial_margin\",\"maintenance_margin\",\"settlement_price\",\"total_profit_loss\",\"floating_profit_loss\",\"realized_profit_loss\",\"size\",\"size_currency\",\"average_price_usd\",\"floating_profit_loss_usd\",\"leverage\",\"realized_funding\",\"interest_value\",\"order_id\",\"order_state\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"time_in_force\",\"is_rebalance\",\"is_liquidation\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"price\",\"label\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"api\",\"web\",\"mobile\",\"refresh_amount\",\"display_amount\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"filled_amount\",\"advanced\",\"implv\",\"usd\",\"triggered\",\"trigger\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger_reference_price\",\"block_trade\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"replaced\",\"auto_replaced\",\"quote\",\"mmp_group\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trigger_order_id\",\"combo_order_id\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"app_name\",\"mmp_cancelled\",\"cancel_reason\",\"oto_order_ids\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"oco_ref\",\"primary_order_id\",\"is_secondary_oto\",\"is_primary_otoco\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_subaccounts_details\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_subaccounts_details\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_transaction_log\",\"description\":\"$7f\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_transaction_log\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_transaction_log\",\"currency\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"query\",\"count\",\"subaccount_id\",\"continuation\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_transaction_log\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_transaction_log\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_user_locks\",\"description\":\"Retrieves information about any account locks or restrictions currently active on the authenticated account. Account locks may be applied for security reasons, compliance requirements, or administrative purposes.\\n\\nThe response includes details about the type of lock, reason, and duration (if applicable). Some locks may prevent trading, withdrawals, or other account operations.\\n\\n**📖 Related Support Article:** [Emergency locking an account](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/25944602715805-Emergency-locking-an-account)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_user_locks)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_user_locks\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_user_locks\",\"currency\",\"enabled\",\"message\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_user_locks\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-get_user_locks\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/list_api_keys\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a list of all API keys associated with the authenticated account. The response includes key details such as ID, name, scope, creation date, last usage, and status (enabled/disabled), but does not include the secret keys for security reasons.\\n\\nUse this method to review and manage your API keys, check their permissions, and monitor their usage.\\n\\n**[TFA required](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/security-keys)**\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Creating new API key on Deribit](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/creating-api-key)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Flist_api_keys)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/list_api_keys\",\"keywords\":[\"private/list_api_keys\",\"timestamp\",\"client_id\",\"client_secret\",\"public_key\",\"max_scope\",\"enabled\",\"default\",\"name\",\"enabled_features\",\"ip_whitelist\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/list_api_keys\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-list_api_keys\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/list_custody_accounts\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a list of all custody accounts associated with the authenticated account for a specific currency. Custody accounts are used for clients who require segregated custody of their assets.\\n\\nThe response includes custody account details such as account name, status, balances, and configuration settings.\\n\\n**📖 Related Support Article:** [Custody Options](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/26533163120413-Custody-Options)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Flist_custody_accounts)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/list_custody_accounts\",\"keywords\":[\"private/list_custody_accounts\",\"currency\",\"name\",\"balance\",\"pending_withdrawal_balance\",\"auto_deposit\",\"client_id\",\"external_id\",\"withdrawal_address\",\"withdrawal_address_change\",\"pending_withdrawal_addres\",\"deposit_address\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/list_custody_accounts\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-list_custody_accounts\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/pme/simulate\",\"description\":\"Calculates the Extended Risk Matrix (ERM) and detailed margin information for Portfolio Margin accounts. The ERM provides a comprehensive view of portfolio risk across different scenarios and market conditions.\\n\\nYou can calculate the ERM for a specific currency or for the entire Cross-Collateral portfolio. The response includes margin requirements, risk metrics, and scenario analysis that helps assess portfolio risk under various market conditions.\\n\\nUse this method to understand margin requirements and risk exposure before making trading decisions in a Portfolio Margin account.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Portfolio Margin](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/25944756247837-Portfolio-Margin)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fpme%2Fsimulate)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/pme/simulate\",\"keywords\":[\"private/pme/simulate\",\"currency\",\"add_positions\",\"simulated_positions\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/pme/simulate\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-simulate\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/remove_api_key\",\"description\":\"Permanently deletes an API key from your account. This operation cannot be undone. Once removed, the API key can no longer be used to authenticate requests, and all applications using this key will lose access.\\n\\nConsider disabling the key first if you want to temporarily suspend access, as disabled keys can be re-enabled later.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Creating new API key on Deribit](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/creating-api-key)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fremove_api_key)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/remove_api_key\",\"keywords\":[\"private/remove_api_key\",\"id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/remove_api_key\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-remove_api_key\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/remove_subaccount\",\"description\":\"Permanently removes a subaccount. The subaccount must be empty (no positions, no open orders, and zero balance) before it can be removed.\\n\\nThis operation cannot be undone. All subaccount data will be permanently deleted.\\n\\n**[TFA required](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/security-keys)**\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Subaccounts](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-subaccounts-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fremove_subaccount)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/remove_subaccount\",\"keywords\":[\"private/remove_subaccount\",\"subaccount_id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/remove_subaccount\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-remove_subaccount\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/reset_api_key\",\"description\":\"Generates a new secret key for an existing API key while keeping the same key ID and other properties. This is useful if the secret has been compromised or needs to be rotated for security purposes.\\n\\nThe old secret becomes invalid immediately, and the new secret is returned in the response. Store the new secret securely as it will not be displayed again. All applications using the old secret will need to be updated with the new secret.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Creating new API key on Deribit](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/creating-api-key)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Freset_api_key)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/reset_api_key\",\"keywords\":[\"private/reset_api_key\",\"id\",\"timestamp\",\"client_id\",\"client_secret\",\"public_key\",\"max_scope\",\"enabled\",\"default\",\"name\",\"enabled_features\",\"ip_whitelist\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/reset_api_key\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-reset_api_key\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/set_announcement_as_read\",\"description\":\"Marks a specific announcement as read. Once marked as read, the announcement will no longer appear in the `get_new_announcements` response, though it will still be available through `get_announcements`.\\n\\nThis helps track which announcements have been viewed and reduces notification clutter.\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fset_announcement_as_read)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/set_announcement_as_read\",\"keywords\":[\"private/set_announcement_as_read\",\"announcement_id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/set_announcement_as_read\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-set_announcement_as_read\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/set_disabled_trading_products\",\"description\":\"Configures which trading products (instruments, currencies, or instrument types) are disabled for a subaccount. Disabled products cannot be traded by the subaccount, providing a way to restrict trading activities.\\n\\nThis is useful for risk management and compliance purposes. Only the main account owner can modify trading product restrictions for subaccounts.\\n\\n**[TFA required](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/security-keys)**\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fset_disabled_trading_products)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/set_disabled_trading_products\",\"keywords\":[\"private/set_disabled_trading_products\",\"user_id\",\"trading_products\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/set_disabled_trading_products\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-set_disabled_trading_products\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/set_email_for_subaccount\",\"description\":\"Assigns an email address to a subaccount. This email can be used for direct login to the subaccount and for receiving notifications.\\n\\nThe email address owner will receive a confirmation email with a link to verify the email address. The email must be confirmed before it can be used for login.\\n\\n**[TFA required](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/security-keys)**\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Subaccounts](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-subaccounts-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fset_email_for_subaccount)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/set_email_for_subaccount\",\"keywords\":[\"private/set_email_for_subaccount\",\"sid\",\"email\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/set_email_for_subaccount\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-set_email_for_subaccount\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/set_email_language\",\"description\":\"Sets the preferred language for email notifications sent to the authenticated account. Supported languages include English (`en`), Korean (`ko`), Chinese (`zh`), Japanese (`ja`), and Russian (`ru`).\\n\\nAll future email notifications will be sent in the selected language. This setting does not affect the language of the web interface or API responses.\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fset_email_language)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/set_email_language\",\"keywords\":[\"private/set_email_language\",\"language\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/set_email_language\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-set_email_language\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/set_member\",\"description\":\"Creates a new Direct Access member, or edits an existing one. Returns the resulting list of all\\nmembers configured for the account.\\n\\nThis method is dedicated to Starbase. See [Starbase Account Model](https://docs.deribit.com/starbase/account-model)\\nfor an explanation of Members, portfolios, and their relationship to Deribit accounts.\\n\\nOmit `member_id` to create a new member; a non-empty `accounts` list is then required, and the\\nmember cannot be created inactive. Pass an existing `member_id` to edit that member's `name` or\\n`accounts` list, or to toggle its `is_active` state — toggling `is_active` and changing\\n`name`/`accounts` cannot be done in the same request, so a pure `is_active` toggle must resend\\nthe member's current `name` and `accounts` values.\\n\\nRequires Direct Access trading to be enabled for the account.\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write` and mainaccount\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fset_member)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/set_member\",\"keywords\":[\"private/set_member\",\"member_id\",\"name\",\"is_active\",\"accounts\",\"members\",\"is_direct_access_allowed\",\"main_uid\",\"m_tstamp\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/set_member\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-set_member\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/set_self_trading_config\",\"description\":\"Configures self-trading prevention settings for the account. Self-trading occurs when orders from the same account (or related subaccounts) match against each other.\\n\\nYou can configure whether self-trading is allowed, blocked, or allowed only for specific scenarios. Settings can be extended to apply to subaccounts as well. For Block RFQ trading, separate self-match prevention settings are available.\\n\\n**📖 Related Support Article:** [Account settings page](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/25944634289693-Account-settings-page#heading-4)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fset_self_trading_config)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/set_self_trading_config\",\"keywords\":[\"private/set_self_trading_config\",\"mode\",\"extended_to_subaccounts\",\"block_rfq_self_match_prevention\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/set_self_trading_config\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-set_self_trading_config\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/simulate_portfolio\",\"description\":\"Calculates portfolio margin requirements and risk metrics for simulated positions or the current portfolio. This method helps you understand margin requirements before opening new positions or assess the impact of potential trades.\\n\\nYou can simulate adding new positions to the current portfolio or calculate margin for a completely simulated portfolio. The response includes initial margin, maintenance margin, available funds, and other risk metrics.\\n\\n**Note:** This method has a restricted rate limit of not more than once per second due to the computational complexity of portfolio margin calculations.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Portfolio Margin](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/25944756247837-Portfolio-Margin)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fsimulate_portfolio)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/simulate_portfolio\",\"keywords\":[\"private/simulate_portfolio\",\"currency\",\"add_positions\",\"simulated_positions\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/simulate_portfolio\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-simulate_portfolio\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/toggle_notifications_from_subaccount\",\"description\":\"Enables or disables email and other notifications for a subaccount. When notifications are disabled, the subaccount will not receive email alerts, trade confirmations, or other notification messages.\\n\\nThis setting only affects notifications sent to the subaccount's email address. Notifications sent to the main account are not affected.\\n\\n**[TFA required](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/security-keys)**\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Subaccounts](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-subaccounts-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Ftoggle_notifications_from_subaccount)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/toggle_notifications_from_subaccount\",\"keywords\":[\"private/toggle_notifications_from_subaccount\",\"sid\",\"state\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/toggle_notifications_from_subaccount\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-toggle_notifications_from_subaccount\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/toggle_subaccount_login\",\"description\":\"Enables or disables direct login access for a subaccount. When login is disabled, the subaccount cannot be accessed directly using email and password authentication, but can still be accessed through the main account.\\n\\nIf login is disabled while an active session exists for the subaccount, that session will be immediately terminated.\\n\\n**[TFA required](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/security-keys)**\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Subaccounts](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-subaccounts-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Ftoggle_subaccount_login)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/toggle_subaccount_login\",\"keywords\":[\"private/toggle_subaccount_login\",\"sid\",\"state\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/toggle_subaccount_login\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/private-toggle_subaccount_login\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_announcements\",\"description\":\"Retrieves platform announcements and important notices. Announcements include system updates, maintenance schedules, new features, policy changes, and other important information.\\n\\nResults are returned in reverse chronological order (newest first). The default `start_timestamp` is the current time, and the `count` parameter must be between 1 and 50 (default is 5).\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_announcements)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_announcements\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_announcements\",\"start_timestamp\",\"count\",\"body\",\"publication_timestamp\",\"important\",\"confirmation\",\"title\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_announcements\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/account-management/public-get_announcements\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Block RFQ\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"private/accept_block_rfq\",\"description\":\"**Taker method**\\n\\nAllows Block RFQ taker to accept a quote by sending a single crossing price. The order can be either filled immediately (`fill_or_kill`) or remain active until cancelled (`good_til_cancelled`).\\n\\n**Note:** After Block RFQ creation, a grace period of 5 seconds begins, during which the taker cannot see quotes or trade the Block RFQ.\\n\\nUse [private/get_block_rfqs](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfqs) to retrieve Block RFQ information, or [private/cancel_block_rfq](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-cancel_block_rfq) to cancel a Block RFQ.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Faccept_block_rfq)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/accept_block_rfq\",\"keywords\":[\"private/accept_block_rfq\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"price\",\"amount\",\"direction\",\"hedge\",\"legs\",\"time_in_force\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/accept_block_rfq\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-accept_block_rfq\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/add_block_rfq_quote\",\"description\":\"**Maker method**\\n\\nAdds a quote to an existing Block RFQ. To calculate individual leg prices, use [private/get_leg_prices](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/combo-books/private-get_leg_prices).\\n\\nUse [private/get_block_rfqs](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfqs) to retrieve Block RFQ information, or [private/edit_block_rfq_quote](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-edit_block_rfq_quote) to modify an existing quote.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fadd_block_rfq_quote)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/add_block_rfq_quote\",\"keywords\":[\"private/add_block_rfq_quote\",\"label\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"amount\",\"direction\",\"legs\",\"hedge\",\"execution_instruction\",\"price\",\"expires_at\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"block_rfq_quote_id\",\"quote_state\",\"filled_amount\",\"replaced\",\"app_name\",\"quote_state_reason\",\"ratio\",\"instrument_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/add_block_rfq_quote\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-add_block_rfq_quote\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_all_block_rfq_quotes\",\"description\":\"**Maker method**\\n\\nCancels all user quotes in all Block RFQs. Optionally cancels all quotes in a specific RFQ if the `block_rfq_id` is provided.\\n\\n**Note:** Mass cancellation by label is not supported. This method will cancel all quotes regardless of their labels. To cancel a single quote, use [private/cancel_block_rfq_quote](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-cancel_block_rfq_quote).\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_all_block_rfq_quotes)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_all_block_rfq_quotes\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_all_block_rfq_quotes\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"detailed\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_all_block_rfq_quotes\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-cancel_all_block_rfq_quotes\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_block_rfq\",\"description\":\"**Taker method**\\n\\nCancels a Block RFQ using the specified `block_rfq_id`.\\n\\nUse [private/get_block_rfqs](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfqs) to retrieve Block RFQ information, or [private/create_block_rfq](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-create_block_rfq) to create a new Block RFQ.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_block_rfq)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_block_rfq\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_block_rfq\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"expiration_timestamp\",\"role\",\"state\",\"taker_rating\",\"makers\",\"amount\",\"min_trade_amount\",\"asks\",\"bids\",\"legs\",\"hedge\",\"combo_id\",\"label\",\"app_name\",\"mark_price\",\"disclosed\",\"taker\",\"index_prices\",\"included_in_taker_rating\",\"trades\",\"trade_trigger\",\"trade_allocations\",\"price\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"execution_instruction\",\"expires_at\",\"ratio\",\"instrument_name\",\"direction\",\"maker\",\"hedge_amount\",\"cancel_reason\",\"user_id\",\"client_info\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_block_rfq\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-cancel_block_rfq\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_block_rfq_quote\",\"description\":\"**Maker method**\\n\\nCancels a single Block RFQ quote. You can identify the quote to cancel using either:\\n\\n- `block_rfq_quote_id` - the unique ID of the quote\\n- `block_rfq_id` + `label` - the Block RFQ ID and the quote label\\n\\n**Note:** Mass cancellation by label is not supported. This method cancels only one quote at a time. To cancel all quotes, use [private/cancel_all_block_rfq_quotes](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-cancel_all_block_rfq_quotes).\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_block_rfq_quote)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_block_rfq_quote\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_block_rfq_quote\",\"block_rfq_quote_id\",\"label\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"quote_state\",\"execution_instruction\",\"price\",\"amount\",\"direction\",\"filled_amount\",\"legs\",\"hedge\",\"replaced\",\"app_name\",\"quote_state_reason\",\"ratio\",\"instrument_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_block_rfq_quote\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-cancel_block_rfq_quote\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_block_rfq_trigger\",\"description\":\"**Taker method**\\n\\nAllows Block RFQ taker to cancel an active trigger for a Block RFQ. The response includes the full Block RFQ object with the trade trigger state set to cancelled.\\n\\nUse [private/get_block_rfqs](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfqs) to retrieve Block RFQ information.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_block_rfq_trigger)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_block_rfq_trigger\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_block_rfq_trigger\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"expiration_timestamp\",\"role\",\"state\",\"taker_rating\",\"makers\",\"amount\",\"min_trade_amount\",\"asks\",\"bids\",\"legs\",\"hedge\",\"combo_id\",\"label\",\"app_name\",\"mark_price\",\"disclosed\",\"taker\",\"index_prices\",\"included_in_taker_rating\",\"trades\",\"trade_trigger\",\"trade_allocations\",\"price\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"execution_instruction\",\"expires_at\",\"ratio\",\"instrument_name\",\"direction\",\"maker\",\"hedge_amount\",\"cancel_reason\",\"user_id\",\"client_info\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_block_rfq_trigger\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-cancel_block_rfq_trigger\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/create_block_rfq\",\"description\":\"**Taker method**\\n\\nCreates a new Block RFQ. Use [private/get_block_rfqs](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfqs) to retrieve Block RFQ information.\\n\\n**Block RFQ pre-allocation:** The taker can split the total amount between different (sub)accounts using the `trade_allocations` parameter. The taker can also allocate to himself. Each allocation must specify either `user_id` (for direct allocation) or `client_info` object (for broker allocation), and `amount`.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcreate_block_rfq)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/create_block_rfq\",\"keywords\":[\"private/create_block_rfq\",\"legs\",\"trade_allocations\",\"hedge\",\"label\",\"makers\",\"disclosed\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"expiration_timestamp\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"role\",\"state\",\"taker_rating\",\"amount\",\"min_trade_amount\",\"asks\",\"bids\",\"combo_id\",\"app_name\",\"mark_price\",\"taker\",\"index_prices\",\"included_in_taker_rating\",\"trades\",\"trade_trigger\",\"price\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"execution_instruction\",\"expires_at\",\"ratio\",\"instrument_name\",\"direction\",\"maker\",\"hedge_amount\",\"cancel_reason\",\"user_id\",\"client_info\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/create_block_rfq\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-create_block_rfq\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/edit_block_rfq_quote\",\"description\":\"**Maker method**\\n\\nEdits a Block RFQ quote using the specified `block_rfq_quote_id`. Alternatively, you can use a combination of `block_rfq_id` and `label` to edit the quote.\\n\\nUse [private/add_block_rfq_quote](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-add_block_rfq_quote) to add new quotes, or [private/cancel_block_rfq_quote](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-cancel_block_rfq_quote) to cancel quotes.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fedit_block_rfq_quote)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/edit_block_rfq_quote\",\"keywords\":[\"private/edit_block_rfq_quote\",\"legs\",\"amount\",\"block_rfq_quote_id\",\"label\",\"hedge\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"price\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"quote_state\",\"execution_instruction\",\"direction\",\"filled_amount\",\"replaced\",\"app_name\",\"quote_state_reason\",\"ratio\",\"instrument_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/edit_block_rfq_quote\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-edit_block_rfq_quote\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_block_rfq_makers\",\"description\":\"Returns a list of all available Block RFQ makers. This method takes no parameters.\\n\\nUse this method to retrieve the list of makers that can be specified when creating a Block RFQ with [private/create_block_rfq](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-create_block_rfq).\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_block_rfq_makers)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_block_rfq_makers\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_block_rfq_makers\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_block_rfq_makers\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfq_makers\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_block_rfq_quotes\",\"description\":\"**Maker method**\\n\\nRetrieves all open quotes for Block RFQs. When a `block_rfq_id` is specified, only the open quotes for that particular Block RFQ will be returned. When a `label` is specified, all quotes with this label are returned. `block_rfq_quote_id` returns one specific quote.\\n\\nUse [private/add_block_rfq_quote](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-add_block_rfq_quote) to add quotes, or [private/get_block_rfqs](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfqs) to retrieve Block RFQ information.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_block_rfq_quotes)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_block_rfq_quotes\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_block_rfq_quotes\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"label\",\"block_rfq_quote_id\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"quote_state\",\"execution_instruction\",\"price\",\"amount\",\"direction\",\"filled_amount\",\"legs\",\"hedge\",\"replaced\",\"app_name\",\"quote_state_reason\",\"ratio\",\"instrument_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_block_rfq_quotes\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfq_quotes\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_block_rfq_user_info\",\"description\":\"Returns identity and rating information for the requesting account and its subaccounts. Includes both group-level and individual user-level alias data, if available.\\n\\nThis information is useful for understanding your Block RFQ maker identity and rating when participating in Block RFQ trades.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_block_rfq_user_info)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_block_rfq_user_info\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_block_rfq_user_info\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_block_rfq_user_info\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfq_user_info\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_block_rfqs\",\"description\":\"Returns a list of Block RFQs that were either created by the user or assigned to them as a maker, sorted in descending order.\\n\\n`trades` and `mark_price` are only visible for the filled Block RFQ. When a `block_rfq_id` is specified, only that particular Block RFQ will be returned. If called by a `taker`, response will additionally include `makers` list and `label` if previously provided. If called by the `maker`, the `trades` will include the maker's alias, but only for trades in which this maker participated. Can be optionally filtered by currency.\\n\\nUse [private/get_block_rfq_quotes](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfq_quotes) to retrieve quotes for Block RFQs.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_rfq:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_block_rfqs)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_block_rfqs\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_block_rfqs\",\"count\",\"state\",\"role\",\"continuation\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"currency\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_block_rfqs\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfqs\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_block_rfq_trades\",\"description\":\"Returns a list of recent Block RFQ trades. Can be optionally filtered by currency.\\n\\nThis is a public method that provides market data about completed Block RFQ trades. For private Block RFQ information, use [private/get_block_rfqs](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-rfq/private-get_block_rfqs).\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_block_rfq_trades)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_block_rfq_trades\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_block_rfq_trades\",\"currency\",\"continuation\",\"count\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_block_rfq_trades\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-rfq/public-get_block_rfq_trades\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Block Trade\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"private/approve_block_trade\",\"description\":\"$80\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/approve_block_trade\",\"keywords\":[\"private/approve_block_trade\",\"timestamp\",\"nonce\",\"role\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/approve_block_trade\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-approve_block_trade\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/execute_block_trade\",\"description\":\"$81\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/execute_block_trade\",\"keywords\":[\"private/execute_block_trade\",\"timestamp\",\"nonce\",\"role\",\"trades\",\"counterparty_signature\",\"app_name\",\"broker_code\",\"broker_name\",\"trade_id\",\"trade_seq\",\"instrument_name\",\"starbase_timestamp\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"advanced\",\"order_id\",\"matching_id\",\"direction\",\"tick_direction\",\"index_price\",\"price\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"iv\",\"underlying_price\",\"liquidation\",\"liquidity\",\"fee\",\"fee_currency\",\"label\",\"state\",\"block_trade_id\",\"block_trade_leg_count\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"block_rfq_quote_id\",\"reduce_only\",\"post_only\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"api\",\"profit_loss\",\"mark_price\",\"legs\",\"combo_id\",\"combo_trade_id\",\"starbase_match_id\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trade_allocations\",\"user_id\",\"client_info\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/execute_block_trade\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-execute_block_trade\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_block_trade\",\"description\":\"Returns information about a specific block trade identified by `block_trade_id`.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Block Trading](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-trading-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_block_trade)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_block_trade\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_block_trade\",\"id\",\"timestamp\",\"trades\",\"app_name\",\"broker_code\",\"broker_name\",\"trade_id\",\"trade_seq\",\"instrument_name\",\"starbase_timestamp\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"advanced\",\"order_id\",\"matching_id\",\"direction\",\"tick_direction\",\"index_price\",\"price\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"iv\",\"underlying_price\",\"liquidation\",\"liquidity\",\"fee\",\"fee_currency\",\"label\",\"state\",\"block_trade_id\",\"block_trade_leg_count\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"block_rfq_quote_id\",\"reduce_only\",\"post_only\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"api\",\"profit_loss\",\"mark_price\",\"legs\",\"combo_id\",\"combo_trade_id\",\"starbase_match_id\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trade_allocations\",\"user_id\",\"client_info\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_block_trade\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-get_block_trade\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_block_trade_requests\",\"description\":\"$82\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_block_trade_requests\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_block_trade_requests\",\"broker_code\",\"nonce\",\"timestamp\",\"trades\",\"app_name\",\"username\",\"role\",\"user_id\",\"broker_name\",\"state\",\"counterparty_state\",\"combo_id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_block_trade_requests\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-get_block_trade_requests\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_block_trades\",\"description\":\"Returns a list of the user's block trades. If currency is not provided, returns block trades for all currencies. `block_rfq_id` can be provided to receive block trades related to that particular Block RFQ.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Block Trading](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-trading-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_block_trades)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_block_trades\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_block_trades\",\"currency\",\"count\",\"start_id\",\"end_id\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"broker_code\",\"timestamp\",\"trades\",\"app_name\",\"broker_name\",\"trade_id\",\"trade_seq\",\"instrument_name\",\"starbase_timestamp\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"advanced\",\"order_id\",\"matching_id\",\"direction\",\"tick_direction\",\"index_price\",\"price\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"iv\",\"underlying_price\",\"liquidation\",\"liquidity\",\"fee\",\"fee_currency\",\"label\",\"state\",\"block_trade_id\",\"block_trade_leg_count\",\"block_rfq_quote_id\",\"reduce_only\",\"post_only\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"api\",\"profit_loss\",\"mark_price\",\"legs\",\"combo_id\",\"combo_trade_id\",\"starbase_match_id\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trade_allocations\",\"user_id\",\"client_info\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_block_trades\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-get_block_trades\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_broker_clients\",\"description\":\"$83\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_broker_clients\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_broker_clients\",\"client_id\",\"include_subaccounts\",\"client_name\",\"company_name\",\"broker_code\",\"main_user_id\",\"broker_sub_user_id\",\"lei\",\"brn\",\"links\",\"client_link_id\",\"user_id\",\"name\",\"note\",\"state\",\"confirmations_required\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_broker_clients\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-get_broker_clients\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_broker_trade_requests\",\"description\":\"**Broker Method** Provides a list of broker block trade requests including pending approvals, declined trades, and expired trades. `timestamp` and `nonce` received in response can be used to approve or reject the pending broker block trade. This method takes no parameters.\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_broker_trade_requests)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_broker_trade_requests\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_broker_trade_requests\",\"timestamp\",\"state\",\"trades\",\"maker\",\"taker\",\"nonce\",\"amount\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"instrument_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_broker_trade_requests\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-get_broker_trade_requests\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_broker_trades\",\"description\":\"**Broker Method** Returns list of broker block trades. If currency is not provided, returns broker block trades for all currencies.\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_broker_trades)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_broker_trades\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_broker_trades\",\"currency\",\"count\",\"start_id\",\"end_id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_broker_trades\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-get_broker_trades\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/invalidate_block_trade_signature\",\"description\":\"Invalidates a block trade signature, effectively cancelling the block trade. This can be called at any time before [private/execute_block_trade](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/block-trade/private-execute_block_trade) is called.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Block Trading](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-trading-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Finvalidate_block_trade_signature)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/invalidate_block_trade_signature\",\"keywords\":[\"private/invalidate_block_trade_signature\",\"signature\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/invalidate_block_trade_signature\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-invalidate_block_trade_signature\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/reject_block_trade\",\"description\":\"$84\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/reject_block_trade\",\"keywords\":[\"private/reject_block_trade\",\"timestamp\",\"nonce\",\"role\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/reject_block_trade\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-reject_block_trade\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/simulate_block_trade\",\"description\":\"Checks if a block trade can be executed without actually executing it. Use this method to verify that a block trade will succeed before proceeding with the actual execution.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Block Trading](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-trading-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fsimulate_block_trade)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/simulate_block_trade\",\"keywords\":[\"private/simulate_block_trade\",\"role\",\"trades\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/simulate_block_trade\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-simulate_block_trade\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/verify_block_trade\",\"description\":\"Verifies and creates a block trade signature. This is the first step in the block trade workflow - the first party calls this method to generate a signature that must be shared with the second party.\\n\\n**Note:** In the API, the `direction` field is always expressed from the maker's perspective. This means that when you accept a block trade as a taker, the direction shown in the API represents the opposite side of your trade. For example, if you are buying puts as a taker, the API will show the operation as a \\\"sell put\\\" (maker's perspective), and you will be verifying and accepting a \\\"sell put\\\" block trade.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Block Trading](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-trading-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `block_trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fverify_block_trade)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/verify_block_trade\",\"keywords\":[\"private/verify_block_trade\",\"timestamp\",\"nonce\",\"role\",\"trades\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/verify_block_trade\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/block-trade/private-verify_block_trade\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Combo Books\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"private/create_combo\",\"description\":\"Verifies and creates a combo book or returns an existing combo matching the given trades. Combos allow trading on multiple instruments (futures and options) simultaneously as a single strategy.\\n\\nIf a combo matching the provided trades already exists, this method returns the existing combo. Otherwise, it creates a new combo book with the specified leg structure.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcreate_combo)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/create_combo\",\"keywords\":[\"private/create_combo\",\"trades\",\"instrument_id\",\"state\",\"state_timestamp\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"legs\",\"instrument_name\",\"amount\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/create_combo\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/combo-books/private-create_combo\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_leg_prices\",\"description\":\"Returns individual leg prices for a given combo structure based on an aggregated price of the strategy and the mark prices of the individual legs.\\n\\n**Note:** Leg prices change dynamically with mark price fluctuations, and the algorithm is calibrated only for conventional option structures and future spreads. This method supports both inverse strategies and known linear structures within a single currency pair.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_leg_prices)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_leg_prices\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_leg_prices\",\"legs\",\"price\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_leg_prices\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/combo-books/private-get_leg_prices\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_combo_details\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a live combo by `combo_id`: legs, combo `state`, `state_timestamp`, `creation_timestamp`, and `instrument_id`. This is not the full instrument spec — use `public/get_instrument` with the same ID for tick size, commissions, and book `state`.\\n\\nLooks up the live combo table only. Unknown IDs fail with `combo not found`; malformed IDs fail with `wrong format`. Expired or archivized combos that `public/get_combo_ids` no longer lists can still be loaded as instruments via `public/get_instrument`.\\n\\nUse [public/get_combo_ids](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/combo-books/public-get_combo_ids) to list live combo IDs.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_combo_details)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_combo_details\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_combo_details\",\"combo_id\",\"instrument_id\",\"state\",\"state_timestamp\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"legs\",\"instrument_name\",\"amount\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_combo_details\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/combo-books/public-get_combo_details\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_combo_ids\",\"description\":\"Retrieves combo IDs for a required settlement `currency`. `\\\"any\\\"` is not accepted here — use `public/get_combos` with `currency=any` for active combos across currencies.\\n\\n`state` defaults to `\\\"any\\\"`, which returns **active and inactive** IDs and excludes `closed`. Pass `\\\"active\\\"` or `\\\"inactive\\\"` to filter. Public clients cannot select `closed` or `archivized`.\\n\\nUse [public/get_combo_details](https://docs.deribit.com/api-reference/combo-books/public-get_combo_details) for legs and timestamps of a live combo. Archivized combos are not in this list; look them up with `public/get_instrument`.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_combo_ids)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_combo_ids\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_combo_ids\",\"currency\",\"state\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_combo_ids\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/combo-books/public-get_combo_ids\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_combos\",\"description\":\"$85\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_combos\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_combos\",\"currency\",\"instrument_id\",\"state\",\"state_timestamp\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"legs\",\"instrument_name\",\"amount\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_combos\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/combo-books/public-get_combos\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"LSP\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"private/get_lsp_participant_config\",\"description\":\"$86\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_lsp_participant_config\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_lsp_participant_config\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_lsp_participant_config\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/lsp/private-get_lsp_participant_config\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_lsp_participants\",\"description\":\"Lists the LSP (Liquidity Support Program) participant subaccounts configured under the authenticated main account.\\n\\nMust be called with an API key belonging to the main account — returns an error if called from a subaccount.\\n\\nUse the `detailed` parameter to include each participant's full configuration alongside its `user_id` and `enabled` state.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Liquidity Support Program (LSP) API Guide](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/lsp-api-guide)\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_lsp_participants)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_lsp_participants\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_lsp_participants\",\"detailed\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_lsp_participants\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/lsp/private-get_lsp_participants\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_lsp_participants_usage\",\"description\":\"$87\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_lsp_participants_usage\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_lsp_participants_usage\",\"user_id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_lsp_participants_usage\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/lsp/private-get_lsp_participants_usage\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_lsp_usage\",\"description\":\"$88\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_lsp_usage\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_lsp_usage\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_lsp_usage\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/lsp/private-get_lsp_usage\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Market Data\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"public/get_apr_history\",\"description\":\"Retrieves historical Annual Percentage Rate (APR) data for yield-generating tokens. APR represents the annualized return rate for holding these tokens on Deribit.\\n\\nThis method is only applicable to yield-generating tokens: `USDE`, `STETH`, `USDC`, and `BUILD`. Use the `limit` parameter to specify the number of days to retrieve (default 365, maximum 365), and `before` to retrieve APR history before a specific epoch day.\\n\\n**📖 Related Support Article:** [Yield reward-bearing coins](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/31424939199261-Yield-reward-bearing-coins)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_apr_history)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_apr_history\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_apr_history\",\"currency\",\"limit\",\"before\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_apr_history\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_apr_history\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_basket_index_composition\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the latest composition of a basket index, including constituents, weights, cap factors, and the index divisor. The composition object is returned as received from the index composition service; Deribit does not remap field names or types.\\n\\nThe `index_name` parameter is case-insensitive. Only basket indexes listed on Deribit are accepted; currently this is `COIN50`. Other Coinbase baskets such as `AI10` or `TECH100` are rejected. An unknown or missing `index_name` returns `invalid_params`.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_basket_index_composition)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_basket_index_composition\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_basket_index_composition\",\"index_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_basket_index_composition\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_basket_index_composition\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_book_summary_by_currency\",\"description\":\"Retrieves summary information such as open interest, 24-hour volume, best bid/ask prices, last trade price, and other market statistics for all instruments in a given currency.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by instrument kind (future, option, etc.). This method provides a quick overview of market activity across all instruments for a currency.\\n\\n**Note:** For real-time updates, we recommend using the WebSocket subscription to `ticker.{instrument_name}.{interval}` instead of polling this endpoint.\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Using the currency Parameter](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/currency-parameter)\\n- [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_book_summary_by_currency)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_book_summary_by_currency\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_book_summary_by_currency\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"instrument_name\",\"high\",\"low\",\"base_currency\",\"quote_currency\",\"volume\",\"bid_price\",\"ask_price\",\"mid_price\",\"mark_price\",\"last\",\"open_interest\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"estimated_delivery_price\",\"volume_usd\",\"volume_notional\",\"current_funding\",\"funding_8h\",\"mark_iv\",\"interest_rate\",\"underlying_index\",\"underlying_price\",\"price_change\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_book_summary_by_currency\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_book_summary_by_currency\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_book_summary_by_instrument\",\"description\":\"Retrieves summary information such as open interest, 24-hour volume, best bid/ask prices, last trade price, mark price, and other market statistics for a specific instrument.\\n\\nThis method provides a quick overview of current market activity and liquidity for a single instrument.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_book_summary_by_instrument)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_book_summary_by_instrument\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_book_summary_by_instrument\",\"instrument_name\",\"high\",\"low\",\"base_currency\",\"quote_currency\",\"volume\",\"bid_price\",\"ask_price\",\"mid_price\",\"mark_price\",\"last\",\"open_interest\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"estimated_delivery_price\",\"volume_usd\",\"volume_notional\",\"current_funding\",\"funding_8h\",\"mark_iv\",\"interest_rate\",\"underlying_index\",\"underlying_price\",\"price_change\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_book_summary_by_instrument\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_book_summary_by_instrument\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_contract_size\",\"description\":\"$89\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_contract_size\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_contract_size\",\"instrument_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_contract_size\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_contract_size\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_currencies\",\"description\":\"Retrieves all cryptocurrencies supported by the Deribit API. Returns a list of available currencies with their codes and basic information.\\n\\nThis method takes no parameters and is useful for discovering which currencies are available for trading on the platform.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Using the currency Parameter](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/currency-parameter)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_currencies)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_currencies\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_currencies\",\"withdrawal_fee\",\"withdrawal_priorities\",\"min_withdrawal_fee\",\"currency\",\"currency_long\",\"min_confirmations\",\"coin_type\",\"in_cross_collateral_pool\",\"apr\",\"network_fee\",\"network_currency\",\"decimals\",\"currency_uuid\",\"coinbase_networks\",\"name\",\"value\",\"resource_name\",\"display_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_currencies\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_currencies\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_delivery_prices\",\"description\":\"Retrieves historical delivery prices for a given index. Delivery prices are the settlement prices used when futures or options contracts expire and are settled.\\n\\nResults can be paginated using the `offset` and `count` parameters. This method is useful for analyzing historical settlement prices and understanding how contracts have been settled over time.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_delivery_prices)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_delivery_prices\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_delivery_prices\",\"index_name\",\"offset\",\"count\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_delivery_prices\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_delivery_prices\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_expirations\",\"description\":\"$8a\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_expirations\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_expirations\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"currency_pair\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_expirations\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_expirations\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_funding_chart_data\",\"description\":\"Retrieves funding rate chart data points for a PERPETUAL instrument within a given time period. The data is formatted for use in charting applications and includes funding rate values at regular intervals.\\n\\nUse the `length` parameter to specify the time period for which to retrieve chart data. This method is useful for visualizing funding rate trends over time.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_funding_chart_data)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_funding_chart_data\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_funding_chart_data\",\"instrument_name\",\"length\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_funding_chart_data\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_funding_chart_data\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_funding_rate_history\",\"description\":\"Retrieves hourly historical funding rate (interest rate) data for a PERPETUAL instrument over a specified time period. Funding rates are periodic payments exchanged between long and short positions in perpetual contracts.\\n\\nThe response includes hourly funding rate values, which can be used to analyze funding rate trends and calculate historical funding costs. This method is applicable only for PERPETUAL instruments.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_funding_rate_history)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_funding_rate_history\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_funding_rate_history\",\"instrument_name\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"timestamp\",\"prev_index_price\",\"index_price\",\"interest_1h\",\"interest_8h\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_funding_rate_history\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_funding_rate_history\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_funding_rate_value\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the funding rate (interest rate) value for a perpetual instrument over a specified time period. Funding rates are periodic payments exchanged between long and short positions in perpetual contracts.\\n\\nThis method is applicable only for PERPETUAL instruments. The funding rate is typically expressed as a percentage and is used to keep the perpetual contract price aligned with the underlying index price.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_funding_rate_value)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_funding_rate_value\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_funding_rate_value\",\"instrument_name\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_funding_rate_value\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_funding_rate_value\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_historical_volatility\",\"description\":\"Provides historical volatility data for a given cryptocurrency. Historical volatility measures the degree of price variation over a past period and is useful for risk assessment and option pricing.\\n\\nThe response includes volatility statistics calculated from historical price movements. This data can be used for portfolio risk analysis and understanding market conditions.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_historical_volatility)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_historical_volatility\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_historical_volatility\",\"currency\",\"timestamp\",\"value\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_historical_volatility\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_historical_volatility\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_index_price\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the current index price value for a given index name. Index prices are used as reference prices for mark price calculations and settlement.\\n\\nUse `get_index_price_names` or `get_supported_index_names` to retrieve available index names.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_index_price)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_index_price\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_index_price\",\"index_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_index_price\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_index_price\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_index_price_names\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the identifiers (names) of all supported price indexes. Price indexes are reference prices used for mark price calculations, settlement, and other market operations.\\n\\nWhen the `extended` parameter is set to `true`, the response includes additional information such as whether future combo creation and option combo creation are enabled for each index.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_index_price_names)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_index_price_names\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_index_price_names\",\"extended\",\"name\",\"future_combo_creation_enabled\",\"option_combo_creation_enabled\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_index_price_names\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_index_price_names\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_instrument\",\"description\":\"$8b\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_instrument\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_instrument\",\"instrument_name\",\"kind\",\"settlement_currency\",\"counter_currency\",\"base_currency\",\"quote_currency\",\"min_trade_amount\",\"instrument_id\",\"is_active\",\"settlement_period\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"tick_size\",\"tick_size_steps\",\"expiration_timestamp\",\"strike\",\"option_type\",\"future_type\",\"instrument_type\",\"contract_size\",\"lot_size\",\"maker_commission\",\"taker_commission\",\"max_liquidation_commission\",\"maker_max_commission\",\"taker_max_commission\",\"liquidation_max_commission\",\"settlement_max_commission\",\"margin_params\",\"trading_bandwidth_fraction\",\"perpetual_dempener\",\"perpetual_max_funding\",\"block_trade_commission\",\"block_trade_tick_size\",\"block_trade_min_trade_amount\",\"max_leverage\",\"max_non_default_leverage\",\"price_index\",\"underlying_type\",\"state\",\"base_currency_uuid\",\"quote_currency_uuid\",\"index_id\",\"product_group\",\"is_csr\",\"is_cbe_routed\",\"above_price\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_instrument\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_instrument\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_instruments\",\"description\":\"$8c\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_instruments\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_instruments\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"expired\",\"extended\",\"settlement_currency\",\"counter_currency\",\"base_currency\",\"quote_currency\",\"min_trade_amount\",\"instrument_name\",\"instrument_id\",\"is_active\",\"settlement_period\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"tick_size\",\"tick_size_steps\",\"expiration_timestamp\",\"strike\",\"option_type\",\"future_type\",\"instrument_type\",\"contract_size\",\"lot_size\",\"maker_commission\",\"taker_commission\",\"max_liquidation_commission\",\"maker_max_commission\",\"taker_max_commission\",\"liquidation_max_commission\",\"settlement_max_commission\",\"margin_params\",\"trading_bandwidth_fraction\",\"perpetual_dempener\",\"perpetual_max_funding\",\"block_trade_commission\",\"block_trade_tick_size\",\"block_trade_min_trade_amount\",\"max_leverage\",\"max_non_default_leverage\",\"price_index\",\"underlying_type\",\"state\",\"base_currency_uuid\",\"quote_currency_uuid\",\"index_id\",\"product_group\",\"is_csr\",\"is_cbe_routed\",\"above_price\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_instruments\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_instruments\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_last_settlements_by_currency\",\"description\":\"$8d\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_last_settlements_by_currency\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_last_settlements_by_currency\",\"currency\",\"type\",\"count\",\"continuation\",\"search_start_timestamp\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_last_settlements_by_currency\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_last_settlements_by_currency\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_last_settlements_by_instrument\",\"description\":\"$8e\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_last_settlements_by_instrument\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_last_settlements_by_instrument\",\"instrument_name\",\"type\",\"count\",\"continuation\",\"search_start_timestamp\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_last_settlements_by_instrument\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_last_settlements_by_instrument\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_last_trades_by_currency\",\"description\":\"$8f\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_last_trades_by_currency\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_last_trades_by_currency\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"start_id\",\"end_id\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"count\",\"sorting\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_last_trades_by_currency\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_last_trades_by_currency\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_last_trades_by_currency_and_time\",\"description\":\"$90\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_last_trades_by_currency_and_time\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_last_trades_by_currency_and_time\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"count\",\"sorting\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_last_trades_by_currency_and_time\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_last_trades_by_currency_and_time\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_last_trades_by_instrument\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the latest trades that have occurred for a specific instrument. Returns trade details including price, amount, direction, timestamp, and trade ID.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by sequence number range or timestamp range. Use the `count` parameter to limit the number of trades returned, and `sorting` to control the order (ascending or descending by trade ID).\\n\\n**Note:** For spot instruments routed to Coinbase Exchange, this call is not supported. Use [Get product trades](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/api-reference/exchange-api/rest-api/products/get-product-trades) directly for full trade history.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_last_trades_by_instrument)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_last_trades_by_instrument\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_last_trades_by_instrument\",\"instrument_name\",\"start_seq\",\"end_seq\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"count\",\"sorting\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_last_trades_by_instrument\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_last_trades_by_instrument\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_last_trades_by_instrument_and_time\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the latest trades that have occurred for a specific instrument within a specified time range. Returns trade details including price, amount, direction, timestamp, and trade ID.\\n\\nUse the `count` parameter to limit the number of trades returned, and `sorting` to control the order (ascending or descending by trade ID). This method is useful for analyzing trading activity over specific time periods.\\n\\n**Note:** For spot instruments routed to Coinbase Exchange, this call is not supported. Use [Get product trades](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/api-reference/exchange-api/rest-api/products/get-product-trades) directly for full trade history.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_last_trades_by_instrument_and_time)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_last_trades_by_instrument_and_time\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_last_trades_by_instrument_and_time\",\"instrument_name\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"count\",\"sorting\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_last_trades_by_instrument_and_time\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_last_trades_by_instrument_and_time\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_mark_price_history\",\"description\":\"Retrieves 5-minute historical mark price data for an instrument. Mark prices are used for margin calculations and position valuations.\\n\\n**Note:** Currently, mark price history is available only for a subset of options that participate in volatility index calculations. All other instruments, including futures and perpetuals, will return an empty list.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_mark_price_history)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_mark_price_history\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_mark_price_history\",\"instrument_name\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_mark_price_history\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_mark_price_history\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_order_book\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the order book (bids and asks) for a given instrument, along with other market values such as best bid/ask prices, last trade price, mark price, and index price.\\n\\nThe order book depth can be controlled using the `depth` parameter, which accepts values from 1 to 10000. The response includes price levels sorted by price (bids descending, asks ascending).\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_order_book)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_order_book\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_order_book\",\"instrument_name\",\"depth\",\"timestamp\",\"state\",\"stats\",\"open_interest\",\"best_bid_price\",\"best_bid_amount\",\"best_ask_price\",\"best_ask_amount\",\"index_price\",\"min_price\",\"max_price\",\"mark_price\",\"last_price\",\"underlying_price\",\"underlying_index\",\"interest_rate\",\"bid_iv\",\"ask_iv\",\"mark_iv\",\"greeks\",\"funding_8h\",\"current_funding\",\"delivery_price\",\"settlement_price\",\"bids\",\"asks\",\"volume\",\"low\",\"high\",\"price_change\",\"volume_usd\",\"delta\",\"gamma\",\"rho\",\"theta\",\"vega\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_order_book\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_order_book\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_order_book_by_instrument_id\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the order book (bids and asks) for a given instrument ID, along with other market values such as best bid/ask prices, last trade price, mark price, and index price.\\n\\nThis method is similar to `get_order_book` but uses instrument ID instead of instrument name. The order book depth can be controlled using the `depth` parameter, which accepts values from 1 to 10000.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_order_book_by_instrument_id)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_order_book_by_instrument_id\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_order_book_by_instrument_id\",\"instrument_id\",\"depth\",\"instrument_name\",\"timestamp\",\"state\",\"stats\",\"open_interest\",\"best_bid_price\",\"best_bid_amount\",\"best_ask_price\",\"best_ask_amount\",\"index_price\",\"min_price\",\"max_price\",\"mark_price\",\"last_price\",\"underlying_price\",\"underlying_index\",\"interest_rate\",\"bid_iv\",\"ask_iv\",\"mark_iv\",\"greeks\",\"funding_8h\",\"current_funding\",\"delivery_price\",\"settlement_price\",\"bids\",\"asks\",\"volume\",\"low\",\"high\",\"price_change\",\"volume_usd\",\"delta\",\"gamma\",\"rho\",\"theta\",\"vega\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_order_book_by_instrument_id\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_order_book_by_instrument_id\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_supported_index_names\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the identifiers (names) of all supported price indexes, optionally filtered by index type. Price indexes are reference prices used for mark price calculations, settlement, and other market operations.\\n\\nUse the `type` parameter to filter indexes by type (e.g., spot, futures, etc.). This method helps discover available indexes for use with other API methods.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_supported_index_names)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_supported_index_names\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_supported_index_names\",\"type\",\"name\",\"future_combo_creation_enabled\",\"option_combo_creation_enabled\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_supported_index_names\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_supported_index_names\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_trade_volumes\",\"description\":\"Retrieves aggregated 24-hour trade volumes for different instrument types and currencies. The volume statistics include all executed trades across the platform.\\n\\n**Note:** Position moves are not included in this volume. Block trades and Block RFQ trades are included in the volume calculations.\\n\\nUse the `extended` parameter to include additional volume statistics and breakdowns.\\n\\n**Note:** For currencies with spot instruments routed to Coinbase Exchange, `spot_volume` is omitted, as are `spot_volume_7d` and `spot_volume_30d` when `extended` is used. Use [Get all product volume](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/api-reference/exchange-api/rest-api/products/get-all-product-volume) for venue spot volume.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_trade_volumes)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_trade_volumes\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_trade_volumes\",\"extended\",\"currency\",\"calls_volume\",\"puts_volume\",\"futures_volume\",\"spot_volume\",\"calls_volume_7d\",\"puts_volume_7d\",\"futures_volume_7d\",\"spot_volume_7d\",\"calls_volume_30d\",\"puts_volume_30d\",\"futures_volume_30d\",\"spot_volume_30d\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_trade_volumes\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_trade_volumes\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_tradingview_chart_data\",\"description\":\"Retrieves publicly available market data formatted for generating TradingView-compatible candle charts. The data includes open, high, low, close (OHLC) prices and volume for specified time intervals.\\n\\nUse the `chart_resolution` parameter to specify the candle interval (e.g., 1m, 5m, 1h, 1d). This method provides the standard format used by TradingView and other charting platforms.\\n\\n**Note:** For spot instruments routed to Coinbase Exchange, this call is not supported. Use [Get product candles](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/api-reference/exchange-api/rest-api/products/get-product-candles) instead.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_tradingview_chart_data)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_tradingview_chart_data\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_tradingview_chart_data\",\"instrument_name\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"resolution\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_tradingview_chart_data\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_tradingview_chart_data\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_volatility_index_data\",\"description\":\"Retrieves volatility index (VIX) chart data formatted as candles. Volatility indexes measure market expectations of future volatility and are useful for risk assessment and trading strategies.\\n\\nUse the `vix_resolution` parameter to specify the candle interval. The data shows historical volatility index values over time and is formatted for use in charting applications.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_volatility_index_data)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_volatility_index_data\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_volatility_index_data\",\"currency\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"resolution\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_volatility_index_data\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_volatility_index_data\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/ticker\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the ticker (24-hour statistics) for a specific instrument. The ticker includes the last trade price, best bid/ask prices, 24-hour high/low, 24-hour volume, open interest, mark price, and other market statistics.\\n\\nThis is a lightweight method for getting current market data for a single instrument. For real-time updates, consider using WebSocket subscriptions to ticker channels.\\n\\n**Note:** For spot instruments routed to Coinbase Exchange, `volume_notional` and `volume_usd` are omitted from `stats`.\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n- [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fticker)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/ticker\",\"keywords\":[\"public/ticker\",\"instrument_name\",\"timestamp\",\"state\",\"stats\",\"open_interest\",\"best_bid_price\",\"best_bid_amount\",\"best_ask_price\",\"best_ask_amount\",\"index_price\",\"min_price\",\"max_price\",\"mark_price\",\"last_price\",\"underlying_price\",\"underlying_index\",\"interest_rate\",\"bid_iv\",\"ask_iv\",\"mark_iv\",\"greeks\",\"funding_8h\",\"current_funding\",\"interest_value\",\"delivery_price\",\"settlement_price\",\"estimated_delivery_price\",\"is_anchor_breached\",\"anchor_min_price\",\"anchor_max_price\",\"volume\",\"low\",\"high\",\"price_change\",\"volume_usd\",\"delta\",\"gamma\",\"rho\",\"theta\",\"vega\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/ticker\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-ticker\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/get_index_chart_data\",\"description\":\"Returns historical price index chart data for the specified index name and time range. The data is formatted for use in charting applications and shows price index values over time.\\n\\nUse the `range` parameter to specify the time period for which to retrieve chart data. This method is useful for visualizing price index trends and historical movements.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_index_chart_data)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_index_chart_data\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_index_chart_data\",\"index_name\",\"range\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_index_chart_data\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/market-data/public-get_index_chart_data\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Session Management\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"private/disable_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"description\":\"Disable Cancel On Disconnect for the connection.\\n\\nWhen change is applied for the account, then every newly opened connection will start with **inactive** Cancel on Disconnect.\\n\\n**WebSocket Only:** This method is designed exclusively for WebSocket connections. Attempting to use it via REST/HTTP will result in an error response.\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fdisable_cancel_on_disconnect)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/disable_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"keywords\":[\"private/disable_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"scope\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/disable_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/session-management/private-disable_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/enable_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"description\":\"$91\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/enable_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"keywords\":[\"private/enable_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"scope\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/enable_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/session-management/private-enable_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"description\":\"Read current Cancel On Disconnect configuration for the account.\\n\\n**Scope:** `account:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_cancel_on_disconnect)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"scope\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/session-management/private-get_cancel_on_disconnect\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/disable_heartbeat\",\"description\":\"Stop sending heartbeat messages. This method takes no parameters.\\n\\n**WebSocket Only:** This method is designed exclusively for WebSocket connections. Attempting to use it via REST/HTTP will result in an error response.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fdisable_heartbeat)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/disable_heartbeat\",\"keywords\":[\"public/disable_heartbeat\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/disable_heartbeat\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/session-management/public-disable_heartbeat\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/set_heartbeat\",\"description\":\"Signals the WebSocket connection to send and request heartbeats. Heartbeats can be used to detect stale connections.\\n\\nWhen heartbeats have been set up, the API server will send `heartbeat` messages and `test_request` messages. Your software should respond to `test_request` messages by sending a `/api/v2/public/test` request. If your software fails to do so, the API server will immediately close the connection. If your account is configured to cancel on disconnect, any orders opened over the connection will be cancelled.\\n\\n**WebSocket Only:** This method is designed exclusively for WebSocket connections. Attempting to use it via REST/HTTP will result in an error response.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fset_heartbeat)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/set_heartbeat\",\"keywords\":[\"public/set_heartbeat\",\"interval\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/set_heartbeat\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/session-management/public-set_heartbeat\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Subscription Management\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"private/subscribe\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to one or more channels. The name of the channel determines what information will be provided, and in what form.\\n\\nFor a complete list of available subscription channels and their notification formats, see [Notifications and Subscriptions](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/notifications).\\n\\n**Note - This method has distinct API rate limiting requirements:** Sustained rate: ~3.3 requests/second. For more information, see [Rate Limits](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/rate-limits).\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Market Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/market-data-collection-best-practices)\\n- [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fsubscribe)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/subscribe\",\"keywords\":[\"private/subscribe\",\"channels\",\"label\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/subscribe\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/subscription-management/private-subscribe\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/unsubscribe\",\"description\":\"Unsubscribe from one or more channels. The response contains only the channels that were successfully unsubscribed in this request.\\n\\nFor a complete list of available subscription channels and their notification formats, see [Notifications and Subscriptions](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/notifications).\\n\\n**Note:** The `result` field in the response contains only the channels that were successfully processed and unsubscribed from this specific request. It does not include all previously subscribed topics. If a channel in the request is invalid, not subscribed, or fails validation, it will not appear in the result.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Funsubscribe)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/unsubscribe\",\"keywords\":[\"private/unsubscribe\",\"channels\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/unsubscribe\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/subscription-management/private-unsubscribe\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/unsubscribe_all\",\"description\":\"Unsubscribe from all the channels subscribed so far. This method takes no parameters.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Funsubscribe_all)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/unsubscribe_all\",\"keywords\":[\"private/unsubscribe_all\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/unsubscribe_all\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/subscription-management/private-unsubscribe_all\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/subscribe\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to one or more channels. This is the same method as `/private/subscribe`, but it can only be used for 'public' channels.\\n\\nFor a complete list of available subscription channels and their notification formats, see [Notifications and Subscriptions](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/notifications).\\n\\n**Note - This method has distinct API rate limiting requirements:** Sustained rate: ~3.3 requests/second. For more information, see [Rate Limits](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/rate-limits).\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Market Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/market-data-collection-best-practices)\\n- [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fsubscribe)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/subscribe\",\"keywords\":[\"public/subscribe\",\"channels\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/subscribe\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/subscription-management/public-subscribe\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/unsubscribe\",\"description\":\"Unsubscribe from one or more channels. The response contains only the channels that were successfully unsubscribed in this request.\\n\\nFor a complete list of available subscription channels and their notification formats, see [Notifications and Subscriptions](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/notifications).\\n\\n**Note:** The `result` field in the response contains only the channels that were successfully processed and unsubscribed from this specific request. It does not include all previously subscribed topics. If a channel in the request is invalid, not subscribed, or fails validation, it will not appear in the result.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Funsubscribe)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/unsubscribe\",\"keywords\":[\"public/unsubscribe\",\"channels\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/unsubscribe\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/subscription-management/public-unsubscribe\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/unsubscribe_all\",\"description\":\"Unsubscribe from all the channels subscribed so far. This method takes no parameters.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Funsubscribe_all)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/unsubscribe_all\",\"keywords\":[\"public/unsubscribe_all\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/unsubscribe_all\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/subscription-management/public-unsubscribe_all\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Supporting\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"public/get_time\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the current time (in milliseconds). This API endpoint can be used to check the clock skew between your software and Deribit's systems.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_time)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/get_time\",\"keywords\":[\"public/get_time\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/get_time\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/supporting/public-get_time\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/hello\",\"description\":\"Method used to introduce the client software connected to Deribit platform over websocket. Provided data may have an impact on the maintained connection and will be collected for internal statistical purposes. In response, Deribit will also introduce itself.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fhello)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/hello\",\"keywords\":[\"public/hello\",\"client_name\",\"client_version\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/hello\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/supporting/public-hello\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/status\",\"description\":\"Method used to get information about locked currencies\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fstatus)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/status\",\"keywords\":[\"public/status\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/status\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/supporting/public-status\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"public/test\",\"description\":\"Tests the connection to the API server, and returns its version. You can use this to make sure the API is reachable, and matches the expected version.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Ftest)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"public/test\",\"keywords\":[\"public/test\",\"expected_result\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /public/test\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/supporting/public-test\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Trading\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"private/buy\",\"description\":\"Places a buy order for an instrument. Supports various order types including limit, market, stop, and advanced order types (stop-limit, take-profit, take-profit-limit, trailing-stop, etc.).\\n\\nYou can specify order parameters such as price, quantity, time-in-force, post-only, reduce-only, and trigger conditions. Orders can be labeled for easier management and tracking.\\n\\n**Note:** For spot orders routed to Coinbase Exchange, fills come back asynchronously. It is recommended to receive fills from the `user.trades` channel.\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Order Management Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/order-management-best-practices)\\n- [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fbuy)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/buy\",\"keywords\":[\"private/buy\",\"instrument_name\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"type\",\"label\",\"price\",\"time_in_force\",\"display_amount\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger\",\"advanced\",\"mmp\",\"valid_until\",\"linked_order_type\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"otoco_config\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/buy\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-buy\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel\",\"description\":\"Cancels a specific order identified by its order ID. The order must be open (not yet filled or cancelled) to be cancelled successfully.\\n\\nOnce cancelled, the order is removed from the order book and cannot be restored. Any unfilled portion of the order will be cancelled.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel\",\"order_id\",\"order_state\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"time_in_force\",\"is_rebalance\",\"is_liquidation\",\"instrument_name\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"label\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"api\",\"web\",\"mobile\",\"refresh_amount\",\"display_amount\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"filled_amount\",\"average_price\",\"advanced\",\"implv\",\"usd\",\"triggered\",\"trigger\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger_reference_price\",\"block_trade\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"replaced\",\"auto_replaced\",\"quote\",\"mmp_group\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trigger_order_id\",\"combo_order_id\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"app_name\",\"mmp_cancelled\",\"cancel_reason\",\"oto_order_ids\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"oco_ref\",\"primary_order_id\",\"is_secondary_oto\",\"is_primary_otoco\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-cancel\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_all\",\"description\":\"Cancels all open orders and trigger orders for the authenticated account across all currencies and instrument kinds. This is a bulk cancellation operation useful for quickly clearing all active orders.\\n\\nUse the `detailed` parameter to receive a list of all cancelled orders. The `freeze_quotes` parameter can be used to freeze quotes instead of cancelling them.\\n\\nSet `include_starbase_orders` to `true` to also cancel the subaccount's Starbase direct-access open orders; the number cancelled is included in the returned cancelled-order count. This flag cannot be combined with `detailed`, and `freeze_quotes` is not enforced for Starbase orders.\\n\\n**Note:** This operation cannot be undone. All open orders will be permanently cancelled.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_all)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_all\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_all\",\"detailed\",\"freeze_quotes\",\"include_starbase_orders\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_all\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-cancel_all\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_all_by_currency\",\"description\":\"Cancels all open orders for a specific currency. This is useful for quickly clearing all orders across multiple instruments in a currency.\\n\\nOrders can be optionally filtered by instrument kind (future, option, etc.) and/or order type (limit, market, stop, etc.). Use the `detailed` parameter to receive a list of all cancelled orders.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_all_by_currency)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_all_by_currency\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_all_by_currency\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"type\",\"detailed\",\"freeze_quotes\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_all_by_currency\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-cancel_all_by_currency\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_all_by_currency_pair\",\"description\":\"Cancels all open orders for a specific currency pair. This is useful for quickly clearing all orders across instruments in a currency pair.\\n\\nOrders can be optionally filtered by instrument kind (future, option, etc.) and/or order type (limit, market, stop, etc.). Use the `detailed` parameter to receive a list of all cancelled orders.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_all_by_currency_pair)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_all_by_currency_pair\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_all_by_currency_pair\",\"currency_pair\",\"kind\",\"type\",\"detailed\",\"freeze_quotes\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_all_by_currency_pair\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-cancel_all_by_currency_pair\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_all_by_instrument\",\"description\":\"Cancels all open orders for a specific instrument. This is useful for quickly clearing all orders for a single instrument.\\n\\nOrders can be optionally filtered by order type (limit, market, stop, etc.). Use the `detailed` parameter to receive a list of all cancelled orders. The `include_combos` parameter can be used to include combo orders in the cancellation.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_all_by_instrument)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_all_by_instrument\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_all_by_instrument\",\"instrument_name\",\"type\",\"detailed\",\"include_combos\",\"freeze_quotes\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_all_by_instrument\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-cancel_all_by_instrument\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_all_by_kind_or_type\",\"description\":\"Cancels all open orders in one or more currencies, optionally filtered by instrument kind and/or order type. This provides flexible bulk cancellation across multiple currencies.\\n\\nSpecify one or more currencies, and optionally filter by instrument kind (future, option, etc.) and/or order type (limit, market, stop, etc.). Use the `detailed` parameter to receive a list of all cancelled orders.\\n\\n`include_starbase_orders` only applies to a full cancel-all (order type `all`); it is ignored when cancelling a specific order type such as `quote`.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_all_by_kind_or_type)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_all_by_kind_or_type\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_all_by_kind_or_type\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"type\",\"detailed\",\"freeze_quotes\",\"include_starbase_orders\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_all_by_kind_or_type\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-cancel_all_by_kind_or_type\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_by_label\",\"description\":\"Cancels all orders (including trigger orders) that have a specific label. This is useful for managing groups of related orders that share the same label.\\n\\nOrders can be cancelled across all currencies or filtered to a specific currency. When cancelling by currency, the currency queue is used for processing.\\n\\n**Rate Limits:** When called without the `currency` parameter, this method is subject to `cancel_all` rate limits. Different rate limit values may apply for per-currency cancels versus calls without providing the currency parameter.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_by_label)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_by_label\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_by_label\",\"label\",\"currency\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_by_label\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-cancel_by_label\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_quotes\",\"description\":\"Cancels quotes (mass quote orders) based on various criteria. This method provides flexible options for cancelling quotes:\\n\\n- `delta`: Cancels quotes within a delta range defined by `min_delta` and `max_delta`\\n- `quote_set_id`: Cancels quotes by a specific Quote Set identifier\\n- `instrument`: Cancels all quotes associated with a particular instrument\\n- `kind`: Cancels all quotes for a certain instrument kind\\n- `currency`: Cancels all quotes in a specified currency\\n- `currency_pair`: Cancels all quotes in a specified currency pair\\n- `all`: Cancels all quotes\\n\\nUse the `detailed` parameter to receive a list of all cancelled quotes.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_quotes)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_quotes\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_quotes\",\"detailed\",\"freeze_quotes\",\"cancel_type\",\"min_delta\",\"max_delta\",\"quote_set_id\",\"instrument_name\",\"kind\",\"currency\",\"currency_pair\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_quotes\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-cancel_quotes\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/close_position\",\"description\":\"Places a reduce-only order to close an existing position. Reduce-only orders can only reduce or close a position; they cannot open a new position or increase an existing one.\\n\\nYou can specify whether to use a market or limit order. If using a limit order, provide the price. The order will automatically be set to reduce-only to ensure it only closes the position.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fclose_position)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/close_position\",\"keywords\":[\"private/close_position\",\"instrument_name\",\"type\",\"price\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/close_position\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-close_position\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/edit\",\"description\":\"Modifies an existing order by changing its price, amount, and/or other properties such as time-in-force, post-only, reduce-only, trigger conditions, or advanced order type.\\n\\nThe order is identified by its order ID. Only open orders can be edited. Changes take effect immediately and may result in the order being filled if the new price matches the market.\\n\\n**Note:** For spot orders routed to Coinbase Exchange, fills come back asynchronously. It is recommended to receive fills from the `user.trades` channel.\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Order Management Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/order-management-best-practices)\\n- [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fedit)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/edit\",\"keywords\":[\"private/edit\",\"order_id\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"price\",\"post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"advanced\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"mmp\",\"valid_until\",\"display_amount\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/edit\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-edit\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/edit_by_label\",\"description\":\"Modifies an order identified by its label. This method works only when there is exactly one open order with the specified label.\\n\\nYou can change the order's price, amount, and/or other properties such as time-in-force, post-only, reduce-only, trigger conditions, or advanced order type. Changes take effect immediately.\\n\\n**Note:** For spot orders routed to Coinbase Exchange, fills come back asynchronously. It is recommended to receive fills from the `user.trades` channel.\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Order Management Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/order-management-best-practices)\\n- [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fedit_by_label)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/edit_by_label\",\"keywords\":[\"private/edit_by_label\",\"label\",\"instrument_name\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"price\",\"post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"advanced\",\"trigger_price\",\"mmp\",\"valid_until\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/edit_by_label\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-edit_by_label\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_margins\",\"description\":\"Calculates margin requirements for a hypothetical order on a given instrument. Returns initial margin and maintenance margin for the specified instrument, quantity, and price.\\n\\nThis method is useful for estimating margin requirements before placing an order, helping to ensure sufficient funds are available and understanding the margin impact of potential trades.\\n\\nFor spot instruments, `amount_type` selects whether `amount` is a base currency quantity (fees charged on top) or a total quote currency spend (fees included).\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Using the currency Parameter](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/currency-parameter)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_margins)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_margins\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_margins\",\"instrument_name\",\"amount\",\"amount_type\",\"price\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_margins\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_margins\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_mmp_config\",\"description\":\"$92\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_mmp_config\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_mmp_config\",\"index_name\",\"mmp_group\",\"block_rfq\",\"interval\",\"frozen_time\",\"quantity_limit\",\"delta_limit\",\"vega_limit\",\"max_quote_quantity\",\"trade_count_limit\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_mmp_config\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_mmp_config\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_mmp_status\",\"description\":\"Retrieves Market Maker Protection (MMP) status for a triggered index or MMP group. Returns the live MMP state including whether MMP is enabled or triggered, remaining frozen time (if triggered), whether quoting is currently allowed, and any active freeze conditions.\\n\\nIf the `index_name` parameter is not provided, a list of all triggered MMP statuses is returned. This method lets you track whether protection is active and when quoting will resume.\\n\\nFor Mass Quotes, specify the `mmp_group` parameter to check status for a specific MMP group. Set `block_rfq` to `true` to retrieve MMP status for Block RFQ (requires `block_rfq:read` scope).\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Market Maker Protection API Configuration](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/market-maker-protection)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read` or `block_rfq:read` (when `block_rfq` = `true`)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_mmp_status)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_mmp_status\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_mmp_status\",\"index_name\",\"mmp_group\",\"block_rfq\",\"frozen_until\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_mmp_status\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_mmp_status\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_open_orders\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a list of all open orders for the authenticated account across all currencies. Open orders are orders that have been placed but not yet filled or cancelled.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by instrument kind and order type. This method provides a comprehensive view of all active orders.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_open_orders)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_open_orders\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_open_orders\",\"kind\",\"type\",\"order_id\",\"order_state\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"time_in_force\",\"is_rebalance\",\"is_liquidation\",\"instrument_name\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"label\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"api\",\"web\",\"mobile\",\"refresh_amount\",\"display_amount\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"filled_amount\",\"average_price\",\"advanced\",\"implv\",\"usd\",\"triggered\",\"trigger\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger_reference_price\",\"block_trade\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"replaced\",\"auto_replaced\",\"quote\",\"mmp_group\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trigger_order_id\",\"combo_order_id\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"app_name\",\"mmp_cancelled\",\"cancel_reason\",\"oto_order_ids\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"oco_ref\",\"primary_order_id\",\"is_secondary_oto\",\"is_primary_otoco\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_open_orders\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_open_orders\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_open_orders_by_currency\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a list of all open orders for a specific currency. Open orders are orders that have been placed but not yet filled or cancelled.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by instrument kind and order type. This method provides a view of all active orders within a currency.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Using the currency Parameter](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/currency-parameter)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_open_orders_by_currency)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_open_orders_by_currency\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_open_orders_by_currency\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"type\",\"order_id\",\"order_state\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"time_in_force\",\"is_rebalance\",\"is_liquidation\",\"instrument_name\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"label\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"api\",\"web\",\"mobile\",\"refresh_amount\",\"display_amount\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"filled_amount\",\"average_price\",\"advanced\",\"implv\",\"usd\",\"triggered\",\"trigger\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger_reference_price\",\"block_trade\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"replaced\",\"auto_replaced\",\"quote\",\"mmp_group\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trigger_order_id\",\"combo_order_id\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"app_name\",\"mmp_cancelled\",\"cancel_reason\",\"oto_order_ids\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"oco_ref\",\"primary_order_id\",\"is_secondary_oto\",\"is_primary_otoco\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_open_orders_by_currency\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_open_orders_by_currency\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_open_orders_by_instrument\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a list of all open orders for a specific instrument. Open orders are orders that have been placed but not yet filled or cancelled.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by order type. This method is useful for checking active orders for a particular instrument.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_open_orders_by_instrument)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_open_orders_by_instrument\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_open_orders_by_instrument\",\"instrument_name\",\"type\",\"order_id\",\"order_state\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"time_in_force\",\"is_rebalance\",\"is_liquidation\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"label\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"api\",\"web\",\"mobile\",\"refresh_amount\",\"display_amount\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"filled_amount\",\"average_price\",\"advanced\",\"implv\",\"usd\",\"triggered\",\"trigger\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger_reference_price\",\"block_trade\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"replaced\",\"auto_replaced\",\"quote\",\"mmp_group\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trigger_order_id\",\"combo_order_id\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"app_name\",\"mmp_cancelled\",\"cancel_reason\",\"oto_order_ids\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"oco_ref\",\"primary_order_id\",\"is_secondary_oto\",\"is_primary_otoco\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_open_orders_by_instrument\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_open_orders_by_instrument\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_open_orders_by_label\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a list of all open orders that have a specific label within a given currency. This is useful for tracking and managing groups of related orders that share the same label.\\n\\nOpen orders are orders that have been placed but not yet filled or cancelled. The label helps organize and identify related orders.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_open_orders_by_label)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_open_orders_by_label\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_open_orders_by_label\",\"currency\",\"label\",\"order_id\",\"order_state\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"time_in_force\",\"is_rebalance\",\"is_liquidation\",\"instrument_name\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"api\",\"web\",\"mobile\",\"refresh_amount\",\"display_amount\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"filled_amount\",\"average_price\",\"advanced\",\"implv\",\"usd\",\"triggered\",\"trigger\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger_reference_price\",\"block_trade\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"replaced\",\"auto_replaced\",\"quote\",\"mmp_group\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trigger_order_id\",\"combo_order_id\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"app_name\",\"mmp_cancelled\",\"cancel_reason\",\"oto_order_ids\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"oco_ref\",\"primary_order_id\",\"is_secondary_oto\",\"is_primary_otoco\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_open_orders_by_label\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_open_orders_by_label\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_order_history_by_currency\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the order history for a specific currency. The history includes orders that have been partially or fully filled, as well as cancelled orders (if `include_unfilled_orders` is set to true).\\n\\nResults can be filtered by instrument kind and paginated using `offset` and `count` parameters, or using continuation tokens. Use `include_old_orders` to include orders from before a certain date, and `historical` to retrieve historical order data.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Accessing Historical Trades and Orders Using API](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/accessing-historical-trades-orders)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_order_history_by_currency)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_order_history_by_currency\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_order_history_by_currency\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"count\",\"offset\",\"include_old\",\"include_unfilled\",\"with_continuation\",\"continuation\",\"historical\",\"order_id\",\"order_state\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"time_in_force\",\"is_rebalance\",\"is_liquidation\",\"instrument_name\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"label\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"api\",\"web\",\"mobile\",\"refresh_amount\",\"display_amount\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"filled_amount\",\"average_price\",\"advanced\",\"implv\",\"usd\",\"triggered\",\"trigger\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger_reference_price\",\"block_trade\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"replaced\",\"auto_replaced\",\"quote\",\"mmp_group\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trigger_order_id\",\"combo_order_id\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"app_name\",\"mmp_cancelled\",\"cancel_reason\",\"oto_order_ids\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"oco_ref\",\"primary_order_id\",\"is_secondary_oto\",\"is_primary_otoco\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_order_history_by_currency\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_order_history_by_currency\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_order_history_by_instrument\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the order history for a specific instrument. The history includes orders that have been partially or fully filled, as well as cancelled orders (if `include_unfilled_orders` is set to true).\\n\\nResults can be paginated using `offset` and `count` parameters, or using continuation tokens. Use `include_old_orders` to include orders from before a certain date, and `historical` to retrieve historical order data.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Accessing Historical Trades and Orders Using API](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/accessing-historical-trades-orders)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_order_history_by_instrument)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_order_history_by_instrument\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_order_history_by_instrument\",\"instrument_name\",\"count\",\"offset\",\"include_old\",\"include_unfilled\",\"with_continuation\",\"continuation\",\"historical\",\"order_id\",\"order_state\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"time_in_force\",\"is_rebalance\",\"is_liquidation\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"label\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"api\",\"web\",\"mobile\",\"refresh_amount\",\"display_amount\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"filled_amount\",\"average_price\",\"advanced\",\"implv\",\"usd\",\"triggered\",\"trigger\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger_reference_price\",\"block_trade\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"replaced\",\"auto_replaced\",\"quote\",\"mmp_group\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trigger_order_id\",\"combo_order_id\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"app_name\",\"mmp_cancelled\",\"cancel_reason\",\"oto_order_ids\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"oco_ref\",\"primary_order_id\",\"is_secondary_oto\",\"is_primary_otoco\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_order_history_by_instrument\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_order_history_by_instrument\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_order_margin_by_ids\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the initial margin requirements for one or more orders identified by their order IDs. Initial margin is the amount of funds required to open a position with these orders.\\n\\nThis method is useful for calculating margin requirements before placing orders, helping to ensure sufficient funds are available.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_order_margin_by_ids)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_order_margin_by_ids\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_order_margin_by_ids\",\"ids\",\"order_id\",\"initial_margin\",\"initial_margin_currency\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_order_margin_by_ids\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_order_margin_by_ids\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_order_state\",\"description\":\"$93\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_order_state\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_order_state\",\"order_id\",\"order_state\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"time_in_force\",\"is_rebalance\",\"is_liquidation\",\"instrument_name\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"label\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"api\",\"web\",\"mobile\",\"refresh_amount\",\"display_amount\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"filled_amount\",\"average_price\",\"advanced\",\"implv\",\"usd\",\"triggered\",\"trigger\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger_reference_price\",\"block_trade\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"replaced\",\"auto_replaced\",\"quote\",\"mmp_group\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trigger_order_id\",\"combo_order_id\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"app_name\",\"mmp_cancelled\",\"cancel_reason\",\"oto_order_ids\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"oco_ref\",\"primary_order_id\",\"is_secondary_oto\",\"is_primary_otoco\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_order_state\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_order_state\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_order_state_by_label\",\"description\":\"$94\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_order_state_by_label\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_order_state_by_label\",\"currency\",\"label\",\"order_id\",\"order_state\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"time_in_force\",\"is_rebalance\",\"is_liquidation\",\"instrument_name\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_last_update_timestamp\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"api\",\"web\",\"mobile\",\"refresh_amount\",\"display_amount\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"filled_amount\",\"average_price\",\"advanced\",\"implv\",\"usd\",\"triggered\",\"trigger\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger_reference_price\",\"block_trade\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"replaced\",\"auto_replaced\",\"quote\",\"mmp_group\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trigger_order_id\",\"combo_order_id\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"app_name\",\"mmp_cancelled\",\"cancel_reason\",\"oto_order_ids\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"oco_ref\",\"primary_order_id\",\"is_secondary_oto\",\"is_primary_otoco\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_order_state_by_label\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_order_state_by_label\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_settlement_history_by_currency\",\"description\":\"$95\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_settlement_history_by_currency\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_settlement_history_by_currency\",\"currency\",\"type\",\"count\",\"continuation\",\"search_start_timestamp\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_settlement_history_by_currency\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_settlement_history_by_currency\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_settlement_history_by_instrument\",\"description\":\"Retrieves settlement, delivery, and bankruptcy events for a specific instrument that have affected your account.\\n\\n**Settlement vs. delivery:** Settlement is a daily event (at 08:00 UTC) for futures and perpetual positions that converts unrealized profit and loss into realized profit and loss. Option positions do not settle. Delivery is a one-time event that occurs when a futures or options contract expires — any remaining open position is closed at the delivery price. Delivery does not apply to perpetual or spot instruments. Both events take place at 08:00 UTC, which is why they are sometimes conflated.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by settlement type and timestamp. Use pagination parameters (`count` and `continuation`) to retrieve large settlement histories. This method is useful for tracking settlement events for a specific instrument.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_settlement_history_by_instrument)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_settlement_history_by_instrument\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_settlement_history_by_instrument\",\"instrument_name\",\"type\",\"count\",\"continuation\",\"search_start_timestamp\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_settlement_history_by_instrument\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_settlement_history_by_instrument\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_trigger_order_history\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a detailed log of all trigger orders (stop orders, take-profit orders, etc.) for the authenticated account. The log includes trigger order creation, activation, execution, and cancellation events.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by currency and instrument name. Use pagination parameters (`count` and `continuation`) to retrieve large trigger order histories. This is useful for tracking trigger order activity and debugging trigger order behavior.\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_trigger_order_history)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_trigger_order_history\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_trigger_order_history\",\"currency\",\"instrument_name\",\"count\",\"continuation\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_trigger_order_history\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_trigger_order_history\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_user_trades_by_currency\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the latest user trades that have occurred for instruments in a specific currency. Returns trade details including price, amount, direction, timestamp, trade ID, and order ID for all instruments in the currency.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by instrument kind, trade ID range, or timestamp range. Use the `count` parameter to limit the number of trades returned, and `sorting` to control the order. To retrieve trades for a specific subaccount, use the `subaccount_id` parameter. Use `historical` to retrieve historical trade data.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Accessing Historical Trades and Orders Using API](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/accessing-historical-trades-orders)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_user_trades_by_currency)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_user_trades_by_currency\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_user_trades_by_currency\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"start_id\",\"end_id\",\"count\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"sorting\",\"historical\",\"subaccount_id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_user_trades_by_currency\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_user_trades_by_currency\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_user_trades_by_currency_and_time\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the latest user trades that have occurred for instruments in a specific currency within a specified time range. Returns trade details including price, amount, direction, timestamp, trade ID, and order ID for all instruments in the currency.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by instrument kind. Use the `count` parameter to limit the number of trades returned, and `sorting` to control the order. Use `historical` to retrieve historical trade data. This method is useful for analyzing trading activity across a currency over specific time periods.\\n\\nMain accounts may use the `subaccount_id` parameter to retrieve trade data for a specific subaccount (requires `mainaccount` scope).\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Accessing Historical Trades and Orders Using API](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/accessing-historical-trades-orders)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_user_trades_by_currency_and_time)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_user_trades_by_currency_and_time\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_user_trades_by_currency_and_time\",\"currency\",\"kind\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"count\",\"sorting\",\"historical\",\"subaccount_id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_user_trades_by_currency_and_time\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_user_trades_by_currency_and_time\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_user_trades_by_instrument\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the latest user trades that have occurred for a specific instrument. Returns trade details including price, amount, direction, timestamp, trade ID, and order ID.\\n\\nResults can be filtered by sequence number range or timestamp range. Use the `count` parameter to limit the number of trades returned, and `sorting` to control the order (ascending or descending by trade ID). Use `historical` to retrieve historical trade data.\\n\\nMain accounts may use the `subaccount_id` parameter to retrieve trade data for a specific subaccount (requires `mainaccount` scope).\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Accessing Historical Trades and Orders Using API](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/accessing-historical-trades-orders)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_user_trades_by_instrument)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_user_trades_by_instrument\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_user_trades_by_instrument\",\"instrument_name\",\"start_seq\",\"end_seq\",\"count\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"historical\",\"sorting\",\"subaccount_id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_user_trades_by_instrument\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_user_trades_by_instrument\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_user_trades_by_instrument_and_time\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the latest user trades that have occurred for a specific instrument within a specified time range. Returns trade details including price, amount, direction, timestamp, trade ID, and order ID.\\n\\nUse the `count` parameter to limit the number of trades returned, and `sorting` to control the order (ascending or descending by trade ID). Use `historical` to retrieve historical trade data. This method is useful for analyzing trading activity over specific time periods.\\n\\nMain accounts may use the `subaccount_id` parameter to retrieve trade data for a specific subaccount (requires `mainaccount` scope).\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Accessing Historical Trades and Orders Using API](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/accessing-historical-trades-orders)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_user_trades_by_instrument_and_time)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_user_trades_by_instrument_and_time\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_user_trades_by_instrument_and_time\",\"instrument_name\",\"start_timestamp\",\"end_timestamp\",\"count\",\"sorting\",\"historical\",\"subaccount_id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_user_trades_by_instrument_and_time\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_user_trades_by_instrument_and_time\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_user_trades_by_order\",\"description\":\"Retrieves all trades that were executed from a specific order. When an order is filled, it may result in multiple trades (partial fills). This method returns all trades associated with a given order ID.\\n\\nResults can be sorted in ascending or descending order by trade ID. Use `historical` to retrieve historical trade data. This is useful for tracking how an order was filled and analyzing execution quality.\\n\\nMain accounts may use the `subaccount_id` parameter to retrieve trade data for a specific subaccount (requires `mainaccount` scope).\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Accessing Historical Trades and Orders Using API](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/accessing-historical-trades-orders)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_user_trades_by_order)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_user_trades_by_order\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_user_trades_by_order\",\"order_id\",\"sorting\",\"historical\",\"subaccount_id\",\"trade_id\",\"trade_seq\",\"instrument_name\",\"timestamp\",\"starbase_timestamp\",\"starbase_order_id\",\"starbase_client_order_id\",\"order_type\",\"original_order_type\",\"advanced\",\"matching_id\",\"direction\",\"tick_direction\",\"index_price\",\"price\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"iv\",\"underlying_price\",\"liquidation\",\"liquidity\",\"fee\",\"fee_currency\",\"label\",\"state\",\"block_trade_id\",\"block_trade_leg_count\",\"block_rfq_id\",\"block_rfq_quote_id\",\"reduce_only\",\"post_only\",\"mmp\",\"risk_reducing\",\"api\",\"profit_loss\",\"mark_price\",\"legs\",\"combo_id\",\"combo_trade_id\",\"starbase_match_id\",\"quote_set_id\",\"quote_id\",\"trade_allocations\",\"user_id\",\"client_info\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_user_trades_by_order\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-get_user_trades_by_order\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/mass_quote\",\"description\":\"$96\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/mass_quote\",\"keywords\":[\"private/mass_quote\",\"wait_for_response\",\"detailed\",\"quote_id\",\"mmp_group\",\"valid_until\",\"quotes\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/mass_quote\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-mass_quote\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/move_positions\",\"description\":\"$97\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/move_positions\",\"keywords\":[\"private/move_positions\",\"currency\",\"source_uid\",\"target_uid\",\"trades\",\"instrument_name\",\"direction\",\"price\",\"amount\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/move_positions\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-move_positions\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/reset_mmp\",\"description\":\"$98\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/reset_mmp\",\"keywords\":[\"private/reset_mmp\",\"index_name\",\"mmp_group\",\"block_rfq\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/reset_mmp\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-reset_mmp\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/sell\",\"description\":\"Places a sell order for an instrument. Supports various order types including limit, market, stop, and advanced order types (stop-limit, take-profit, take-profit-limit, trailing-stop, etc.).\\n\\nYou can specify order parameters such as price, quantity, time-in-force, post-only, reduce-only, and trigger conditions. Orders can be labeled for easier management and tracking. Market Maker Protection (MMP) can be enabled to prevent excessive quoting.\\n\\n**Note:** For spot orders routed to Coinbase Exchange, fills come back asynchronously. It is recommended to receive fills from the `user.trades` channel.\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Order Management Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/order-management-best-practices)\\n- [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\\n**Scope:** `trade:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fsell)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/sell\",\"keywords\":[\"private/sell\",\"instrument_name\",\"amount\",\"contracts\",\"type\",\"label\",\"price\",\"time_in_force\",\"display_amount\",\"post_only\",\"reject_post_only\",\"reduce_only\",\"trigger_price\",\"trigger_offset\",\"trigger\",\"advanced\",\"mmp\",\"valid_until\",\"linked_order_type\",\"trigger_fill_condition\",\"otoco_config\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/sell\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-sell\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/set_mmp_config\",\"description\":\"$99\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/set_mmp_config\",\"keywords\":[\"private/set_mmp_config\",\"index_name\",\"interval\",\"frozen_time\",\"mmp_group\",\"quantity_limit\",\"delta_limit\",\"vega_limit\",\"max_quote_quantity\",\"block_rfq\",\"trade_count_limit\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/set_mmp_config\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/trading/private-set_mmp_config\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Wallet\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"private/add_to_address_book\",\"description\":\"$9a\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/add_to_address_book\",\"keywords\":[\"private/add_to_address_book\",\"currency\",\"type\",\"address\",\"network\",\"tag\",\"counterparty_id\",\"label\",\"beneficiary_vasp_name\",\"beneficiary_vasp_did\",\"beneficiary_vasp_website\",\"beneficiary_first_name\",\"beneficiary_last_name\",\"beneficiary_company_name\",\"beneficiary_address\",\"agreed\",\"personal\",\"extra_currencies\",\"name\",\"country\",\"financial_institution\",\"account\",\"account_location\",\"entity_type\",\"wallet_type\",\"is_self\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"info_required\",\"status\",\"waiting_timestamp\",\"requires_confirmation\",\"requires_confirmation_change\",\"requires_security_key\",\"kind\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"network_display_name\",\"beneficiary_created\",\"beneficiary_updated\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/add_to_address_book\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-add_to_address_book\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_transfer_by_id\",\"description\":\"Cancel a pending transfer by its ID. This method allows you to cancel a transfer that has not yet been processed. Once a transfer is processed, it cannot be cancelled.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Transfers](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-transfers-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_transfer_by_id)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_transfer_by_id\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_transfer_by_id\",\"currency\",\"id\",\"created_timestamp\",\"type\",\"amount\",\"other_side\",\"state\",\"direction\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"nonce\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_transfer_by_id\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-cancel_transfer_by_id\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/cancel_withdrawal\",\"description\":\"Cancels a pending withdrawal request. This method allows you to cancel a withdrawal that has not yet been processed. Once a withdrawal is processed, it cannot be cancelled.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Withdrawals](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-withdrawals-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcancel_withdrawal)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/cancel_withdrawal\",\"keywords\":[\"private/cancel_withdrawal\",\"currency\",\"id\",\"address\",\"amount\",\"confirmed_timestamp\",\"created_timestamp\",\"fee\",\"priority\",\"state\",\"transaction_id\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"nonce\",\"transfer_idem\",\"network\",\"network_display_name\",\"destination_tag\",\"payment_id\",\"source_ctn_id\",\"destination_ctn_id\",\"clearance_state\",\"note\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/cancel_withdrawal\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-cancel_withdrawal\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/coinbase/estimate_withdrawal_fee\",\"description\":\"Estimates the network fee for a withdrawal on the given currency and network. **Available to institutional Coinbase wallet type accounts only.**\\n\\nThe `network_name` parameter is not validated against `coinbase_networks`; it is passed through to the custodian. The networks available for each currency are returned by `public/get_currencies` in the `coinbase_networks` field.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Withdrawals](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-withdrawals-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fcoinbase%2Festimate_withdrawal_fee)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/coinbase/estimate_withdrawal_fee\",\"keywords\":[\"private/coinbase/estimate_withdrawal_fee\",\"currency\",\"network_name\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/coinbase/estimate_withdrawal_fee\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-estimate_withdrawal_fee\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/create_deposit_address\",\"description\":\"$9b\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/create_deposit_address\",\"keywords\":[\"private/create_deposit_address\",\"currency\",\"network\",\"label\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"address\",\"type\",\"kind\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"status\",\"waiting_timestamp\",\"requires_confirmation\",\"requires_confirmation_change\",\"requires_security_key\",\"info_required\",\"network_display_name\",\"tag\",\"name\",\"country\",\"financial_institution\",\"account\",\"account_location\",\"entity_type\",\"wallet_type\",\"is_self\",\"beneficiary_created\",\"beneficiary_updated\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/create_deposit_address\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-create_deposit_address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/delete_address_beneficiary\",\"description\":\"Deletes beneficiary information for a specific address.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Withdrawals](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-withdrawals-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fdelete_address_beneficiary)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/delete_address_beneficiary\",\"keywords\":[\"private/delete_address_beneficiary\",\"currency\",\"address\",\"tag\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/delete_address_beneficiary\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-delete_address_beneficiary\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_address_beneficiary\",\"description\":\"Retrieves beneficiary information for a specific address. Returns the stored beneficiary details including VASP information, personal details, and wallet type classification.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Withdrawals](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-withdrawals-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_address_beneficiary)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_address_beneficiary\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_address_beneficiary\",\"currency\",\"address\",\"tag\",\"user_id\",\"agreed\",\"personal\",\"unhosted\",\"beneficiary_vasp_name\",\"beneficiary_vasp_did\",\"beneficiary_vasp_website\",\"beneficiary_first_name\",\"beneficiary_last_name\",\"beneficiary_company_name\",\"beneficiary_address\",\"created\",\"updated\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_address_beneficiary\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-get_address_beneficiary\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_address_book\",\"description\":\"$9c\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_address_book\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_address_book\",\"currency\",\"type\",\"address\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"label\",\"beneficiary_vasp_name\",\"beneficiary_vasp_did\",\"beneficiary_vasp_website\",\"beneficiary_first_name\",\"beneficiary_last_name\",\"beneficiary_company_name\",\"beneficiary_address\",\"agreed\",\"personal\",\"info_required\",\"status\",\"waiting_timestamp\",\"requires_confirmation\",\"requires_confirmation_change\",\"requires_security_key\",\"kind\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"network\",\"network_display_name\",\"tag\",\"name\",\"country\",\"financial_institution\",\"account\",\"account_location\",\"entity_type\",\"wallet_type\",\"is_self\",\"beneficiary_created\",\"beneficiary_updated\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_address_book\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-get_address_book\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_current_deposit_address\",\"description\":\"Retrieve the current deposit address for the specified currency. Returns the most recently created or used deposit address for receiving funds.\\n\\n**Coinbase wallet type**\\n\\nFor Coinbase wallet type accounts the `network` parameter is required and selects the blockchain network of the deposit address. The networks available for each currency are returned by `public/get_currencies` in the `coinbase_networks` field. Returns `null` when no deposit address exists for the given currency and network. This method is available to institutional Coinbase accounts only.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Deposits](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-deposits-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_current_deposit_address)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_current_deposit_address\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_current_deposit_address\",\"currency\",\"network\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"address\",\"type\",\"kind\",\"label\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"status\",\"waiting_timestamp\",\"requires_confirmation\",\"requires_confirmation_change\",\"requires_security_key\",\"info_required\",\"network_display_name\",\"tag\",\"name\",\"country\",\"financial_institution\",\"account\",\"account_location\",\"entity_type\",\"wallet_type\",\"is_self\",\"beneficiary_created\",\"beneficiary_updated\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_current_deposit_address\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-get_current_deposit_address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_deposits\",\"description\":\"Retrieve the latest user deposits. Returns a list of deposit transactions with their status, amounts, addresses, confirmations, and other relevant details.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Deposits](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-deposits-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_deposits)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_deposits\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_deposits\",\"currency\",\"count\",\"offset\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_deposits\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-get_deposits\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_reward_eligibility\",\"description\":\"Returns reward eligibility status and APR data for all supported currencies.\\n\\nThis method takes no parameters.\\n\\n**📖 Related Support Article:** [Yield reward-bearing coins](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/31424939199261-Yield-reward-bearing-coins)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_reward_eligibility)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_reward_eligibility\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_reward_eligibility\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_reward_eligibility\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-get_reward_eligibility\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_transfers\",\"description\":\"Retrieve the user's transfers list. Returns a list of internal transfers between accounts, subaccounts, or to other users, including their status, amounts, and other relevant details.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Transfers](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-transfers-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_transfers)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_transfers\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_transfers\",\"currency\",\"count\",\"offset\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_transfers\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-get_transfers\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/get_withdrawals\",\"description\":\"Retrieve the latest user withdrawals. Returns a list of withdrawal requests with their status, amounts, addresses, and other relevant details.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Withdrawals](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-withdrawals-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fget_withdrawals)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/get_withdrawals\",\"keywords\":[\"private/get_withdrawals\",\"currency\",\"count\",\"offset\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/get_withdrawals\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-get_withdrawals\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/list_address_beneficiaries\",\"description\":\"Lists address beneficiaries with optional filtering and pagination. Returns all saved beneficiary information for addresses, with support for filtering by currency, address, wallet type, VASP details, and date ranges.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Withdrawals](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-withdrawals-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Flist_address_beneficiaries)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/list_address_beneficiaries\",\"keywords\":[\"private/list_address_beneficiaries\",\"currency\",\"address\",\"tag\",\"created_before\",\"created_after\",\"updated_before\",\"updated_after\",\"personal\",\"unhosted\",\"beneficiary_vasp_name\",\"beneficiary_vasp_did\",\"beneficiary_vasp_website\",\"limit\",\"continuation\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/list_address_beneficiaries\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-list_address_beneficiaries\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/remove_from_address_book\",\"description\":\"Removes an entry from the address book. This method allows you to delete a saved address that is no longer needed.\\n\\n**Coinbase wallet type**\\n\\nFor Coinbase wallet type accounts the required parameters are `currency` (portfolio currencies or `\\\"all\\\"`) and `type`, plus one of `address` or `id` (the entry identifier returned by `private/get_address_book`). Use `network` and `tag` together with `address` to disambiguate entries sharing the same address.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Withdrawals](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-withdrawals-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fremove_from_address_book)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/remove_from_address_book\",\"keywords\":[\"private/remove_from_address_book\",\"currency\",\"type\",\"address\",\"network\",\"tag\",\"id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/remove_from_address_book\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-remove_from_address_book\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/save_address_beneficiary\",\"description\":\"Saves beneficiary information for an address. This method allows you to store beneficiary details required for compliance purposes, including VASP information, personal details, and wallet type classification.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Withdrawals](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-withdrawals-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fsave_address_beneficiary)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/save_address_beneficiary\",\"keywords\":[\"private/save_address_beneficiary\",\"currency\",\"address\",\"tag\",\"agreed\",\"personal\",\"unhosted\",\"beneficiary_vasp_name\",\"beneficiary_vasp_did\",\"beneficiary_vasp_website\",\"beneficiary_first_name\",\"beneficiary_last_name\",\"beneficiary_company_name\",\"beneficiary_address\",\"user_id\",\"created\",\"updated\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/save_address_beneficiary\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-save_address_beneficiary\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/set_address_requires_security_key\",\"description\":\"Sets whether withdrawals to the given address book address require a security key. Returns the updated address book entry.\\n\\n**Coinbase wallet type**\\n\\nFor Coinbase wallet type accounts the entry is identified by one of `address` or `id` (the entry identifier returned by `private/get_address_book`) instead of `address` alone. Use `network` and `tag` together with `address` to disambiguate entries sharing the same address. The `mainaccount` scope is not required for Coinbase wallet type accounts.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Withdrawals](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-withdrawals-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read_write` and mainaccount\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fset_address_requires_security_key)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/set_address_requires_security_key\",\"keywords\":[\"private/set_address_requires_security_key\",\"currency\",\"type\",\"address\",\"network\",\"tag\",\"id\",\"value\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"label\",\"beneficiary_vasp_name\",\"beneficiary_vasp_did\",\"beneficiary_vasp_website\",\"beneficiary_first_name\",\"beneficiary_last_name\",\"beneficiary_company_name\",\"beneficiary_address\",\"agreed\",\"personal\",\"info_required\",\"status\",\"waiting_timestamp\",\"requires_confirmation\",\"requires_confirmation_change\",\"requires_security_key\",\"kind\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"network_display_name\",\"name\",\"country\",\"financial_institution\",\"account\",\"account_location\",\"entity_type\",\"wallet_type\",\"is_self\",\"beneficiary_created\",\"beneficiary_updated\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/set_address_requires_security_key\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-set_address_requires_security_key\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/set_clearance_originator\",\"description\":\"Sets originator of the deposit\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fset_clearance_originator)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/set_clearance_originator\",\"keywords\":[\"private/set_clearance_originator\",\"deposit_id\",\"originator\",\"currency\",\"address\",\"amount\",\"state\",\"transaction_id\",\"source_address\",\"received_timestamp\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"note\",\"clearance_state\",\"refund_transaction_id\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/set_clearance_originator\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-set_clearance_originator\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/set_coinbase_subaccount_withdrawals_allowed\",\"description\":\"Allows or disallows withdrawals from subaccounts. Can be called only by the main account; subaccounts receive a `forbidden` error. The setting applies to Coinbase wallet type withdrawals — when disabled, `private/withdraw` requests from subaccounts of a Coinbase wallet type account are rejected.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Withdrawals](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-withdrawals-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fset_coinbase_subaccount_withdrawals_allowed)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/set_coinbase_subaccount_withdrawals_allowed\",\"keywords\":[\"private/set_coinbase_subaccount_withdrawals_allowed\",\"enabled\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/set_coinbase_subaccount_withdrawals_allowed\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-set_coinbase_subaccount_withdrawals_allowed\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/submit_transfer_between_subaccounts\",\"description\":\"Transfer funds between two subaccounts or between a subaccount and the main account.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Transfers](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-transfers-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallets:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fsubmit_transfer_between_subaccounts)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/submit_transfer_between_subaccounts\",\"keywords\":[\"private/submit_transfer_between_subaccounts\",\"currency\",\"amount\",\"destination\",\"source\",\"nonce\",\"created_timestamp\",\"type\",\"other_side\",\"state\",\"direction\",\"updated_timestamp\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/submit_transfer_between_subaccounts\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-submit_transfer_between_subaccounts\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/submit_transfer_to_subaccount\",\"description\":\"Transfer funds from the main account to a subaccount.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Transfers](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-transfers-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallets:read_write`\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fsubmit_transfer_to_subaccount)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/submit_transfer_to_subaccount\",\"keywords\":[\"private/submit_transfer_to_subaccount\",\"currency\",\"amount\",\"destination\",\"created_timestamp\",\"type\",\"other_side\",\"state\",\"direction\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"nonce\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/submit_transfer_to_subaccount\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-submit_transfer_to_subaccount\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/submit_transfer_to_user\",\"description\":\"Transfer funds to another user. This method allows you to send funds from your main account to another Deribit user's account. The transfer is processed internally and does not require blockchain transactions.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Managing Transfers](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/managing-transfers-api)\\n\\n**Scope:** `wallet:read_write` and mainaccount\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fprivate%2Fsubmit_transfer_to_user)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/submit_transfer_to_user\",\"keywords\":[\"private/submit_transfer_to_user\",\"currency\",\"amount\",\"destination\",\"created_timestamp\",\"type\",\"other_side\",\"state\",\"direction\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"nonce\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/submit_transfer_to_user\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-submit_transfer_to_user\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/update_in_address_book\",\"description\":\"$9d\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/update_in_address_book\",\"keywords\":[\"private/update_in_address_book\",\"currency\",\"type\",\"address\",\"network\",\"tag\",\"id\",\"label\",\"beneficiary_vasp_name\",\"beneficiary_vasp_did\",\"beneficiary_vasp_website\",\"beneficiary_first_name\",\"beneficiary_last_name\",\"beneficiary_company_name\",\"beneficiary_address\",\"agreed\",\"personal\",\"name\",\"country\",\"financial_institution\",\"account\",\"account_location\",\"entity_type\",\"wallet_type\",\"is_self\",\"kind\",\"creation_timestamp\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"status\",\"waiting_timestamp\",\"requires_confirmation\",\"requires_confirmation_change\",\"requires_security_key\",\"info_required\",\"network_display_name\",\"beneficiary_created\",\"beneficiary_updated\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/update_in_address_book\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-update_in_address_book\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"private/withdraw\",\"description\":\"$9e\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"og:title\":\"private/withdraw\",\"keywords\":[\"private/withdraw\",\"currency\",\"address\",\"amount\",\"network\",\"tag\",\"id\",\"priority\",\"nonce\",\"confirmed_timestamp\",\"created_timestamp\",\"fee\",\"state\",\"transaction_id\",\"updated_timestamp\",\"transfer_idem\",\"network_display_name\",\"destination_tag\",\"payment_id\",\"source_ctn_id\",\"destination_ctn_id\",\"clearance_state\",\"note\"],\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_upcoming_openapi.json get /private/withdraw\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/upcoming/wallet/private-withdraw\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]}]}]},{\"dropdown\":\"Subscription Channels\",\"icon\":\"rss\",\"groups\":[{\"group\":\"Introduction\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Notifications\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to Deribit WebSocket notification channels for real-time order updates, trade fills, market data changes, and account events across sessions.\",\"keywords\":[\"WebSocket subscriptions\",\"real-time notifications\",\"market data subscriptions\",\"order book updates\",\"account notifications\",\"subscription channels\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit API Notifications and Subscriptions - Real-Time Data Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to subscribe to Deribit API notifications for real-time market data, order book updates, account changes, and trading events via WebSocket.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit API Notifications Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Deribit API notifications and WebSocket subscriptions for real-time market data and account updates.\",\"href\":\"/articles/notifications\"}]},{\"group\":\"Websockets\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"Platform\",\"pages\":[{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json platform_state\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/platform/platform_state\",\"title\":\"platform_state \",\"description\":\"Platform state notifications.\\n\\nUse this channel to monitor whether the Deribit platform is operational and to detect maintenance periods or partial outages that may affect trading, authentication, or market data.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json platform_state.public_methods_state\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/platform/platform_statepublic_methods_state\",\"title\":\"platform_state.public_methods_state \",\"description\":\"Notifications indicating whether unauthenticated (public) requests are currently allowed.\\n\\nThis is useful for monitoring service availability for public endpoints (e.g., market data) without authentication.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Announcements\",\"pages\":[{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json announcements\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/announcements/announcements\",\"title\":\"announcements \",\"description\":\"General announcements concerning the Deribit platform.\\n\\nSubscribe to receive operational messages such as maintenance notices, incidents, and important platform updates.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Orderbook\",\"pages\":[{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json book.(instrument_name).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/orderbook/bookinstrument_nameinterval\",\"title\":\"book.(instrument_name).(interval) \",\"description\":\"$9f\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json book.(instrument_name).(group).(depth).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/orderbook/bookinstrument_namegroupdepthinterval\",\"title\":\"book.(instrument_name).(group).(depth).(interval) \",\"description\":\"Aggregated order book updates for a specific instrument.\\n\\nNotifications are sent once per specified `interval`, with prices grouped (rounded) according to `group`, and the book truncated to the specified `depth` (number of price levels).\\n\\nThe `asks` and `bids` fields are both lists of `[price, amount]` pairs.\\n\\n- `price`: price level, rounded according to `group` (USD per BTC)\\n- `amount`: total amount at that price level\\n\\nFor Starbase-routed instruments, the published price levels include accepted mass-quote liquidity.\\n\\n**Units:** For perpetual and inverse futures the amount is in USD units. For options and linear futures it is in the underlying base currency coin.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Market Data\",\"pages\":[{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json ticker.(instrument_name).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/tickerinstrument_nameinterval\",\"title\":\"ticker.(instrument_name).(interval) \",\"description\":\"$a0\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json incremental_ticker.(instrument_name)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/incremental_tickerinstrument_name\",\"title\":\"incremental_ticker.(instrument_name) \",\"description\":\"Real-time ticker updates for an instrument, delivered as a snapshot followed by incremental updates.\\n\\n- The first notification contains the full ticker snapshot.\\n- Subsequent notifications contain only fields that changed since the previous update.\\n\\nThis event is sent at most once per second.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json perpetual.(instrument_name).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/perpetualinstrument_nameinterval\",\"title\":\"perpetual.(instrument_name).(interval) \",\"description\":\"Provide current interest rate - but only for **perpetual** instruments. Other types won't generate any notification.\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json quote.(instrument_name)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/quoteinstrument_name\",\"title\":\"quote.(instrument_name) \",\"description\":\"Best bid/ask price and size for a specific instrument.\\n\\nThis subscription provides top-of-book updates (best bid and best ask) without the full depth of the order book. Use it when you only need the current spread and top sizes.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json deribit_price_index.(index_name)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/deribit_price_indexindex_name\",\"title\":\"deribit_price_index.(index_name) \",\"description\":\"Deribit index price updates for the given `index_name` (current index value).\\n\\nUse this channel to track the real-time value of a Deribit index (e.g., `btc_usd`), which is used across pricing, margining, and settlement-related calculations.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json deribit_price_ranking.(index_name)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/deribit_price_rankingindex_name\",\"title\":\"deribit_price_ranking.(index_name) \",\"description\":\"Price ranking updates for the component exchanges used to calculate the Deribit index.\\n\\nUse this channel to see per-exchange price contributions that feed into the index calculation for the given `index_name`.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json deribit_price_statistics.(index_name)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/deribit_price_statisticsindex_name\",\"title\":\"deribit_price_statistics.(index_name) \",\"description\":\"Basic statistics for the Deribit index.\\n\\nProvides statistical information related to the given `index_name` (e.g., aggregated stats derived from index updates). Useful for monitoring index behavior over time.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json deribit_volatility_index.(index_name)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/deribit_volatility_indexindex_name\",\"title\":\"deribit_volatility_index.(index_name) \",\"description\":\"Volatility index updates for the given `index_name`.\\n\\nUse this channel to receive volatility index values (e.g., DVOL-like measures) as they update.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json markprice.options.(index_name)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/markpriceoptionsindex_name\",\"title\":\"markprice.options.(index_name) \",\"description\":\"Options mark price updates for the given `index_name`.\\n\\nUse this channel to receive mark prices for options under the given index, useful for valuation, risk monitoring, and P\u0026L calculations.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json estimated_expiration_price.(index_name)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/estimated_expiration_priceindex_name\",\"title\":\"estimated_expiration_price.(index_name) \",\"description\":\"Estimated expiration (delivery) price updates for the given `index_name`.\\n\\nProvides calculated estimates of the ending price used around expirations/settlement. Useful for monitoring expected settlement levels.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json chart.trades.(instrument_name).(resolution)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/charttradesinstrument_nameresolution\",\"title\":\"chart.trades.(instrument_name).(resolution) \",\"description\":\"Publicly available market data used to generate a TradingView trade candle chart.\\n\\nDuring a single resolution period, many events can be sent, each with updated values for the recent period.\\n\\n**Notice:** When there is no trade during the requested resolution period (e.g. 1 minute), a filling sample is generated which uses data from the last available trade candle (open and close values).\\n\\n**Note:** For spot instruments routed to Coinbase Exchange, this channel is not supported. Use [Get product candles](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/api-reference/exchange-api/rest-api/products/get-product-candles) instead.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json instrument.creation.(kind).(currency)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/instrumentcreationkindcurrency\",\"title\":\"instrument.creation.(kind).(currency) \",\"description\":\"Notification published once when an instrument is created, carrying full instrument data in the same format as `public/get_instruments`.\\n\\nThe notification fires exactly once at creation time, regardless of the instrument's initial state.\\n\\n**Subscription examples:**\\n\\n| Channel | Description |\\n|---|---|\\n| `instrument.creation.any.any` | All instruments |\\n| `instrument.creation.future.BTC` | BTC futures only |\\n| `instrument.creation.option.any` | All options |\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json instrument.state.(kind).(currency)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/market-data/instrumentstatekindcurrency\",\"title\":\"instrument.state.(kind).(currency) \",\"description\":\"Notifications about new or terminated instruments of a given kind in a given currency.\\n\\nUse this channel to track instrument lifecycle events (new listings, expirations/terminations) without polling.\\n\\n**Note:** Our system does not send notifications when currencies are locked. Users are advised to subscribe to the [platform_state](https://docs.deribit.com/subscriptions/platform/platform_state) channel to monitor the state of currencies actively.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Trades\",\"pages\":[{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json trades.(instrument_name).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/trades/tradesinstrument_nameinterval\",\"title\":\"trades.(instrument_name).(interval) \",\"description\":\"Trade notifications for a specific instrument.\\n\\nUse this channel to receive executed trades as they happen for the given instrument. The `interval` controls how frequently trade events are aggregated.\\n\\n**Note:** For spot instruments routed to Coinbase Exchange, this channel is not supported. Use the [`matches` channel](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/exchange/websocket-feed/channels) for the full trade tape. For user trades, orders and changes, use the `user` channels.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json trades.(kind).(currency).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/trades/tradeskindcurrencyinterval\",\"title\":\"trades.(kind).(currency).(interval) \",\"description\":\"Trade notifications across all instruments for a given kind and currency.\\n\\nUse this channel when you want a consolidated stream of trades across all instruments of a specific `kind` (e.g., futures, options) and `currency`. The `interval` controls aggregation frequency.\\n\\n**Note:** For spot instruments routed to Coinbase Exchange, this channel is not supported with `kind` = `spot`: the subscription is rejected for any currency that is the base or the quote of a routed pair, and for `currency` = `any` whenever any pair is routed. Other kinds are unaffected. Use the [`matches` channel](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/exchange/websocket-feed/channels) for the full trade tape.\\n\\n**📖 Related Articles:** \\n- [Using the currency Parameter](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/currency-parameter)\\n- [Spot Trading: Deribit and Coinbase-Routed Instruments](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/spot-trading-venues)\\n- [Options Data Collection Best Practices](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/options-data-collection-best-practices)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Block Trade\",\"pages\":[{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json block_trade_confirmations\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/block-trade/block_trade_confirmations\",\"title\":\"block_trade_confirmations \",\"description\":\"Provides notifications regarding block trade approval. Subscribe to this channel to receive notifications about pending block trades that require your approval.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Block Trading](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-trading-api)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json block_trade_confirmations.(currency)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/block-trade/block_trade_confirmationscurrency\",\"title\":\"block_trade_confirmations.(currency) \",\"description\":\"Provides notifications regarding block trade approval. Supports filtering by currency. Subscribe to this channel to receive notifications about pending block trades that require your approval, filtered by a specific currency.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Block Trading](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-trading-api)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"User\",\"pages\":[{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.mmp_trigger.(index_name)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/usermmp_triggerindex_name\",\"title\":\"user.mmp_trigger.(index_name) \",\"description\":\"$a1\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.portfolio.(currency)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userportfoliocurrency\",\"title\":\"user.portfolio.(currency) \",\"description\":\"$a2\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.trades.(instrument_name).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/usertradesinstrument_nameinterval\",\"title\":\"user.trades.(instrument_name).(interval) \",\"description\":\"User trade notifications for a specific instrument.\\n\\nReceive private trade events for your account for the given instrument. The `interval` controls how frequently events are aggregated.\\n\\n**Block RFQ trades:** Trades resulting from Block RFQ execution are included in this channel. These trades carry the following additional fields:\\n- `block_rfq_id` — ID of the Block RFQ.\\n- `block_trade_id` — ID of the resulting block trade.\\n- `block_rfq_quote_id` — ID of the accepted quote (present on the **maker** side only).\\n- `order_id` — always present for direct trade participants (makers and takers).\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.trades.(kind).(currency).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/usertradeskindcurrencyinterval\",\"title\":\"user.trades.(kind).(currency).(interval) \",\"description\":\"User trade notifications across all instruments for a given kind and currency.\\n\\nReceive a consolidated stream of your private trades across all instruments matching the specified `kind` and `currency`. The `interval` controls aggregation frequency.\\n\\n**Block RFQ trades:** Trades resulting from Block RFQ execution are included in this channel. See `user.trades.{instrument_name}.{interval}` for the complete list of Block RFQ-specific fields.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.combo_trades.(instrument_name).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/usercombo_tradesinstrument_nameinterval\",\"title\":\"user.combo_trades.(instrument_name).(interval) \",\"description\":\"User trade notifications for a specific combo instrument.\\n\\nTrades include a `legs` field describing the underlying legs of the combo. The `interval` controls aggregation frequency.\\n\\n**Block RFQ trades:** Block RFQ does not support combo instruments. RFQ-executed trades do not appear in this channel.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.combo_trades.(kind).(currency).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/usercombo_tradeskindcurrencyinterval\",\"title\":\"user.combo_trades.(kind).(currency).(interval) \",\"description\":\"User trade notifications across all combo instruments for a given kind and currency.\\n\\nTrades include a `legs` field describing the underlying legs. The `interval` controls aggregation frequency.\\n\\n**Block RFQ trades:** Block RFQ does not support combo instruments. RFQ-executed trades do not appear in this channel.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.orders.(instrument_name).raw\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userordersinstrument_nameraw\",\"title\":\"user.orders.(instrument_name).raw \",\"description\":\"User order updates for a specific instrument (raw stream).\\n\\nUse this channel to receive private order updates for the given instrument with the highest granularity (raw). Prefer this for real-time order state tracking.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.orders.(instrument_name).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userordersinstrument_nameinterval\",\"title\":\"user.orders.(instrument_name).(interval) \",\"description\":\"User order updates for a specific instrument (aggregated).\\n\\nUse this channel to receive private order updates for the given instrument, aggregated according to `interval`.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.orders.(kind).(currency).raw\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userorderskindcurrencyraw\",\"title\":\"user.orders.(kind).(currency).raw \",\"description\":\"User order updates across all instruments for a given kind and currency (raw stream).\\n\\nUse this channel to receive private order updates across all matching instruments with the highest granularity (raw).\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.orders.(kind).(currency).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userorderskindcurrencyinterval\",\"title\":\"user.orders.(kind).(currency).(interval) \",\"description\":\"User order updates across all instruments for a given kind and currency (aggregated).\\n\\nUse this channel to receive private order updates across all matching instruments, aggregated according to `interval`.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.changes.(instrument_name).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userchangesinstrument_nameinterval\",\"title\":\"user.changes.(instrument_name).(interval) \",\"description\":\"User change stream (orders, trades, and related updates) for a specific instrument.\\n\\nThis channel provides a consolidated private update stream for your account for the given instrument. Use it when you want a single feed instead of subscribing to orders and trades separately.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.changes.(kind).(currency).(interval)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userchangeskindcurrencyinterval\",\"title\":\"user.changes.(kind).(currency).(interval) \",\"description\":\"User change stream (orders, trades, and related updates) across all instruments for a given kind and currency.\\n\\nThis channel provides a consolidated private update stream for your account across all matching instruments. Use it when you want a single feed instead of subscribing to orders and trades separately.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.access_log\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/useraccess_log\",\"title\":\"user.access_log \",\"description\":\"Security event notifications for the account.\\n\\nUse this channel to monitor account-related security events (e.g., access log entries) and build alerting around suspicious activity.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.lock\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userlock\",\"title\":\"user.lock \",\"description\":\"Notifications when the account is locked or unlocked.\\n\\nUse this channel to react to account lock events (e.g., pause trading workflows) and to detect when access is restored.\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.liquidation\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userliquidation\",\"title\":\"user.liquidation \",\"description\":\"$a3\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.isolated.liquidation\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userisolatedliquidation\",\"title\":\"user.isolated.liquidation \",\"description\":\"Lets a **main** account observe the liquidation, ADL, and LSP activity of all of its **isolated-margin subaccounts**, without subscribing to each subaccount's own `user.liquidation` channel individually.\\n\\nEvery event on this channel is a fan-out copy of an event also delivered on the affected subaccount's own `user.liquidation` channel — the payload is identical, including `isolated: true` and the subaccount's `user_id`. The main account's *own* liquidation activity is never delivered here; it stays on the main account's regular `user.liquidation` channel.\\n\\nRequires the `account:read` scope on an API key belonging to the **main account**, and is only available while isolated margin is enabled on the platform.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Liquidity Support Program (LSP) API Guide](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/lsp-api-guide)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json user.lsp\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/user/userlsp\",\"title\":\"user.lsp \",\"description\":\"$a4\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Block Rfq\",\"pages\":[{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json block_rfq.maker.(currency)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/block-rfq/block_rfqmakercurrency\",\"title\":\"block_rfq.maker.(currency) \",\"description\":\"$a5\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json block_rfq.taker.(currency)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/block-rfq/block_rfqtakercurrency\",\"title\":\"block_rfq.taker.(currency) \",\"description\":\"Get notifications about the state of your Block RFQ. `trades` are only visible if the Block RFQ was filled.\\n\\n**Note:** After Block RFQ creation, a grace period of 5 seconds begins, during which the taker cannot see quotes or trade the Block RFQ.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json block_rfq.maker.quotes.(currency)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/block-rfq/block_rfqmakerquotescurrency\",\"title\":\"block_rfq.maker.quotes.(currency) \",\"description\":\"Get notifications about the state of your Block RFQ quotes. Subscribe to this channel to receive real-time updates when your quotes are added, edited, cancelled, or when quotes are accepted by takers.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true},{\"asyncapi\":\"specifications/deribit_upcoming_asyncapi.json block_rfq.trades.(currency)\",\"href\":\"/subscriptions/upcoming/block-rfq/block_rfqtradescurrency\",\"title\":\"block_rfq.trades.(currency) \",\"description\":\"Get notifications about recent Block RFQ trades. This is a public channel that provides market data about completed Block RFQ trades.\\n\\n**📖 Related Article:** [Deribit Block RFQ API walkthrough](https://docs.deribit.com/articles/block-rfq-api-walkthrough)\\n\",\"version\":null,\"autogeneratedByAsyncApi\":true}]}]}]},{\"dropdown\":\"FIX API\",\"icon\":\"bolt\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"Overview\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Deribit Upcoming FIX API Overview\",\"description\":\"Overview of the upcoming Deribit FIX 4.4 release with new fields and messages, covering endpoints, supported message types, and migration guidance.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"FIX API\",\"FIX protocol\",\"institutional trading\",\"FIX 4.4\",\"financial information exchange\",\"trading protocol\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit FIX API Overview - Institutional Trading Protocol\",\"og:description\":\"Complete overview of Deribit's FIX API for institutional trading. Learn about connection endpoints, message structure, session management, and order execution.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit FIX API Overview\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Deribit's FIX API for institutional trading including endpoints, message types, and protocol specifications.\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/overview\"}]},{\"group\":\"Session Management\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Logon(A) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"Logon(A) authenticates and starts a FIX session on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, negotiating heartbeat interval and cancel-on-disconnect.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/logon\"},{\"title\":\"Logout(5) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"Logout(5) cleanly ends a FIX session on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release and controls whether working orders are cancelled on disconnect.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/logout\"},{\"title\":\"Heartbeat(0) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"Heartbeat(0) keeps the FIX session alive on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release and lets peers detect broken connections during idle time.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/heartbeat\"},{\"title\":\"Test Request(1) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"TestRequest(1) solicits a Heartbeat response to verify the upcoming Deribit FIX API release session is responsive during idle trading periods.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/test-request\"},{\"title\":\"Resend Request(2) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"ResendRequest(2) recovers missed FIX messages from the upcoming Deribit FIX API release by asking the counterparty to resend a sequence number range.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/resend-request\"},{\"title\":\"Reject(3) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"Reject(3) is a session-level reject issued by the upcoming Deribit FIX API release server for malformed messages or protocol violations with reason codes.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/reject\"},{\"title\":\"Sequence Reset(4) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"SequenceReset(4) adjusts FIX sequence numbers on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release session to recover from gaps or after a graceful reset.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/sequence-reset\"}]},{\"group\":\"Market Data\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Security List Request(x) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"SecurityListRequest(x) requests the full tradable instrument catalogue from the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, filterable by underlying and kind.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/security-list-request\"},{\"title\":\"Security List(y) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"SecurityList(y) is the server response containing tradable instruments for the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, returned per SecurityListRequest with details.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/security-list\"},{\"title\":\"Market Data Request(V) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"MarketDataRequest(V) subscribes or unsubscribes from order book and trade streams on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release with request scope settings.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/market-data-request\"},{\"title\":\"Market Data Request Reject(Y) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"MarketDataRequestReject(Y) is sent when a market data subscription is rejected on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release with reason codes for the failure.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/market-data-request-reject\"},{\"title\":\"Market Data Snapshot/Full Refresh(W) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"MarketDataSnapshotFullRefresh(W) is the initial full order book snapshot sent before incremental updates begin on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/market-data-snapshot\"},{\"title\":\"Market Data Incremental Refresh(X) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"MarketDataIncrementalRefresh(X) streams incremental order book and trade updates on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release after a snapshot.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/market-data-incremental\"},{\"title\":\"Security Status Request(e) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"SecurityStatusRequest(e) subscribes to trading status updates for an instrument on the upcoming Deribit FIX API: halts, resumes, and settlement.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/security-status-request\"},{\"title\":\"Security Status(f) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"SecurityStatus(f) is a server-pushed notice of trading status changes (halt, resume, settlement) for an instrument on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/security-status\"}]},{\"group\":\"Order Management\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"New Order Single(D) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"NewOrderSingle(D) submits a new single-instrument order on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, supporting limit, market, and advanced order types.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/new-order-single\"},{\"title\":\"Order Cancel Request(F) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"OrderCancelRequest(F) cancels a single working order on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release by ClOrdID or OrderID, with ExecutionReport response.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/order-cancel-request\"},{\"title\":\"Order Cancel Reject(9) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"OrderCancelReject(9) rejects a cancel or cancel/replace request on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, including reason codes for the failure.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/order-cancel-reject\"},{\"title\":\"Order Cancel/Replace Request(G) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"OrderCancelReplaceRequest(G) amends price or quantity of a working order on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release without cancelling and resubmitting.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/order-cancel-replace\"},{\"title\":\"Order Mass Cancel Request(q) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"OrderMassCancelRequest(q) cancels all working orders matching filters (instrument, side, underlying) in one call on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/order-mass-cancel-request\"},{\"title\":\"Order Mass Cancel Report(r) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"OrderMassCancelReport(r) reports the outcome of an order mass cancel on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, with affected order counts and status.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/order-mass-cancel-report\"},{\"title\":\"Order Mass Status Request(AF) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"OrderMassStatusRequest(AF) queries the status of many working orders in a single request on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release for reconciliation.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/order-mass-status-request\"},{\"title\":\"Execution Reports(8) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"ExecutionReport(8) delivers order lifecycle updates (fills, cancels, rejects, replaces) on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release for each order.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/execution-reports\"}]},{\"group\":\"Position Management\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Request For Positions(AN) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"RequestForPositions(AN) requests a snapshot of open positions from the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, returned as PositionReport messages.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/request-for-positions\"},{\"title\":\"Position Report(AP) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"PositionReport(AP) is a server-pushed report of open positions on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, sent in response to RequestForPositions or trades.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/position-report\"}]},{\"group\":\"User Management\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"User Request(BE) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"UserRequest(BE) requests user status changes such as logging users in or out of a session on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release endpoint layer.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/user-request\"},{\"title\":\"User Response(BF) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"UserResponse(BF) is the server response to a UserRequest on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, reporting the current user session status and details.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/user-response\"}]},{\"group\":\"Market Maker Protection\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"MMProtection Limits (MM) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"MMProtectionLimits(MM) configures market maker protection thresholds (quantity, delta, freeze time) on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/mmprotection-limits\"},{\"title\":\"MMProtection Limits Result/Reject(MR) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"MMProtectionLimitsResult(MR) is the response with current MMP settings or a reject on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release market maker protection endpoint.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/mmprotection-limits-result\"},{\"title\":\"MMProtection Reset(MZ) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"MMProtectionReset(MZ) clears a triggered market maker protection freeze on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release so quoting can resume trading.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/mmprotection-reset\"}]},{\"group\":\"Mass Quoting\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Mass Quote(i) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"MassQuote(i) submits many two-sided quotes in one message on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release for market makers seeking low-latency quoting.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/mass-quote\"},{\"title\":\"Mass Quote Acknowledgement(b) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"MassQuoteAcknowledgement(b) confirms a MassQuote submission on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release with per-quote acceptance or reject details.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/mass-quote-acknowledgement\"},{\"title\":\"Quote Cancel(Z) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"QuoteCancel(Z) cancels one or many outstanding mass quotes on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release without submitting new replacement quotes.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/quote-cancel\"}]},{\"group\":\"Trade Capture\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"TradeCaptureReportRequest(AD) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"TradeCaptureReportRequest(AD) requests historical or streaming trade capture reports on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, filterable by criteria.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/trade-capture-report-request\"},{\"title\":\"TradeCaptureReportRequestAck(AQ) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"TradeCaptureReportRequestAck(AQ) acknowledges a TradeCaptureReportRequest on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release and signals whether reports will follow.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/trade-capture-report-request-ack\"},{\"title\":\"TradeCaptureReport(AE) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"TradeCaptureReport(AE) delivers executed trade details on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release, sent for TradeCaptureReportRequest or unsolicited.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/trade-capture-report\"}]},{\"group\":\"Security Definition\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Security Definition Request(c) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"SecurityDefinitionRequest(c) requests detailed contract definitions for one instrument on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release before subscribing.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/security-definition-request\"},{\"title\":\"Security Definition(d) (Upcoming FIX API)\",\"description\":\"SecurityDefinition(d) is the server response describing an instrument's contract terms and trading parameters on the upcoming Deribit FIX API release.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/fix-api/upcoming/security-definition\"}]}]},{\"dropdown\":\"Starbase API\",\"icon\":\"rocket\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"Introduction\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Starbase API Overview\",\"description\":\"Introduction to Deribit Starbase covering the low-latency binary and FIX API stack, gateway architecture, product scope, and migration from legacy SBE.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase API\",\"binary protocol\",\"institutional trading\",\"multicast\",\"gateway connectivity\"],\"og:title\":\"Deribit Starbase API Overview - High-Performance Binary Protocol\",\"og:description\":\"Complete overview of Deribit's Starbase API including Binary API, multicast channels, and gateway connectivity for institutional trading.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Deribit Starbase API Overview\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Deribit's Starbase high-performance binary protocol API for institutional trading.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/overview\"},{\"title\":\"Starbase Connectivity Quickstart\",\"description\":\"Plan Starbase network access, assign a Member before creating API keys, connect to test gateways and multicast feeds, and prepare for production.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase quickstart\",\"Member\",\"API key\",\"connectivity\",\"LD4\",\"cross-connect\",\"AWS Private Link\",\"SBE\",\"multicast\",\"FIX Drop Copy\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Connectivity Quickstart\",\"og:description\":\"Step-by-step guide to assigning a Starbase Member, creating API keys, connecting to gateways and multicast feeds, and preparing for production.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Connectivity Quickstart\",\"twitter:description\":\"Assign a Member, create Starbase API keys, validate gateway and multicast connectivity, and prepare a resilient production deployment.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/quickstart\"},{\"title\":\"Creating and Assigning a Member\",\"description\":\"Create a Starbase Member on the main account and assign every subaccount that will trade before you generate API keys.\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase Member\",\"create Member\",\"assign Member\",\"No active member\",\"Direct Access\",\"portfolio\"],\"og:title\":\"Creating and Assigning a Starbase Member\",\"og:description\":\"Create a Starbase Member, assign main-account and subaccount UIDs, and avoid the No active member error before creating API keys.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Creating and Assigning a Starbase Member\",\"twitter:description\":\"How to create a Starbase Member and assign accounts before creating API keys.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/starbase/creating-member\"},{\"title\":\"Creating a Starbase API Key\",\"description\":\"Create Starbase API keys, pick Starbase-specific scopes, and resolve the No active member error after the target account belongs to a Member.\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase API key\",\"create Starbase key\",\"SBE API key\",\"FIX Drop Copy\",\"SBE Order Entry\",\"REST\"],\"og:title\":\"Creating Starbase API Keys\",\"og:description\":\"Step-by-step guide to creating API keys for Starbase with the correct scopes after Member assignment.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Creating Starbase API Keys\",\"twitter:description\":\"How to create Starbase API keys and configure scopes for the Starbase matching engine.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/starbase/creating-api-key\"},{\"title\":\"Production Readiness Checklist\",\"description\":\"Readiness checklist for clients onboarding to Starbase SBE order entry: Member setup, API key scopes, MMP risk bypass, SBE XMLs, and logon testing.\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"checklist\",\"production readiness\",\"SBE order entry\",\"MMP\",\"risk bypass\",\"SBE XML\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Production Readiness Checklist\",\"og:description\":\"Confirm Member setup, API key scopes, MMP risk bypass, the latest SBE XMLs, and session logon for Starbase order entry.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Production Readiness Checklist\",\"twitter:description\":\"Readiness checklist for Starbase SBE order entry.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"href\":\"/starbase/production-readiness-checklist\"},{\"title\":\"Infrastructure, Connectivity \u0026 Best Practices\",\"description\":\"Deployment options, commercial considerations, gateway architecture, protocols, failover, and low-latency integration guidance for Starbase.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"infrastructure\",\"colocation\",\"cross-connect\",\"AWS Private Link\",\"connectivity\",\"gateway\",\"failover\",\"best practices\",\"cancel on disconnect\",\"CoD\",\"FIX drop copy\",\"multicast\",\"LD4\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Infrastructure, Connectivity \u0026 Best Practices\",\"og:description\":\"Guide to Starbase deployment options, connectivity, gateway architecture, protocols, failover, and best practices for latency-sensitive clients.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Infrastructure \u0026 Connectivity\",\"twitter:description\":\"Guide to Starbase deployment options, connectivity, gateway architecture, protocols, failover, and best practices.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/connectivity-best-practices\"}]},{\"group\":\"API Reference\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Binary API Reference\",\"description\":\"Complete reference for the Starbase Binary API, covering SBE encoding, order entry messages, market data channels, and session lifecycle handling.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"reference\",\"order entry\",\"market data\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Binary API Reference\",\"og:description\":\"Complete reference guide for the Starbase Binary API including all order entry operations and market data.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Binary API Reference\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete reference guide for the Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/binary-api-reference\"},{\"group\":\"Session Messages\",\"expanded\":false,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Starbase Session Messages\",\"description\":\"Session-level messages in the Starbase Binary API: logon and sequence-number handling, weekly sequence reset, heartbeat, logout, and session rejects.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"session\",\"logon\",\"logout\",\"heartbeat\",\"resend\",\"gap fill\",\"reject\",\"sequence reset\",\"resetSeqNum\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Session Messages\",\"og:description\":\"Session-level messages for establishing, maintaining, and terminating connections in the Starbase Binary API.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Session Messages\",\"twitter:description\":\"Session-level messages for the Starbase Binary API including logon, logout, heartbeat, and resend.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/session-messages\"}]},{\"group\":\"Order Entry Messages\",\"expanded\":false,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Placing a New Order\",\"description\":\"Submit new orders via the Starbase Binary API. Covers NewOrderRequest, NewOrderResponse, and NewOrderReject messages, including supported order types and flags.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"NewOrderRequest\",\"NewOrderResponse\",\"NewOrderReject\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Placing a New Order\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to placing new orders in Starbase Binary API including request, response, and reject messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Placing a New Order\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to placing new orders in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/placing-new-order\"},{\"title\":\"Amending an Order\",\"description\":\"Amend existing orders using the Starbase Binary API including AmendOrderRequest, AmendOrderResponse, and AmendOrderReject messages.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"AmendOrderRequest\",\"AmendOrderResponse\",\"AmendOrderReject\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Amending an Order\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to amending existing orders in Starbase Binary API including request, response, and reject messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Amending an Order\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to amending existing orders in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/amending-order\"},{\"title\":\"Cancelling an Order\",\"description\":\"Cancel a working order with the Starbase Binary API. Covers CancelOrderRequest, CancelOrderResponse, and CancelOrderReject message flow and error codes.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"CancelOrderRequest\",\"CancelOrderResponse\",\"CancelOrderReject\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Cancelling an Order\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to cancelling orders in Starbase Binary API including request, response, and reject messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Cancelling an Order\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to cancelling orders in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/cancelling-order\"},{\"title\":\"Mass Quotes\",\"description\":\"Submit many two-sided quotes in one Starbase Binary API message with MassQuoteRequest, MassQuoteResponse, and MassQuoteReject message details.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"MassQuoteRequest\",\"MassQuoteResponse\",\"MassQuoteReject\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Mass Quotes\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to placing multiple quotes in Starbase Binary API including request, response, and reject messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Mass Quotes\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to placing multiple quotes in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/mass-quotes\"},{\"title\":\"Starbase Mass Cancel Messages\",\"description\":\"Cancel many Starbase orders and quotes at once using MassCancelRequest, MassQuoteCancelRequest, and the currency_pair_id sourced from InstrumentDefinition.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"MassCancelRequest\",\"MassCancelResponse\",\"MassCancelReject\",\"MassQuoteCancelRequest\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Mass Cancel\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to cancelling multiple orders and quotes in Starbase Binary API including request, response, and reject messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Mass Cancel\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to cancelling multiple orders and quotes in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/mass-cancel\"}]},{\"group\":\"Market Data Messages\",\"expanded\":false,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Maintaining the order book\",\"description\":\"Maintain order books using the Starbase Binary API including Buy Put, Sell Put, Buy Amount Reduced, Sell Amount Reduced, and Order Delete messages.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"market data\",\"order book\",\"Buy Put\",\"Sell Put\",\"Order Delete\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Maintaining the order book\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to maintaining order books in Starbase Binary API including incremental updates and order deletions.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Maintaining the order book\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to maintaining order books in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/order-book-maintenance\"},{\"title\":\"Trades\",\"description\":\"Trade messages on the Starbase Binary API. Covers Trade Summary, Trade, and Block Trade feeds, including execution details and counterparty data for reporting.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"market data\",\"trades\",\"Trade Summary\",\"Trade\",\"Block Trade\",\"block trade\",\"Block RFQ\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Trades\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to trade messages in Starbase Binary API including Trade Summary, Trade, and Block Trade messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Trades\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to trade messages in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/trades\"},{\"title\":\"Starbase Reference Data and Instrument Definitions\",\"description\":\"Instrument metadata for the Starbase Binary API, including InstrumentDefinition fields, index and mark price sources, and quantityExponent snapshot behavior.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"market data\",\"reference data\",\"InstrumentDefinition\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Reference Data\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to reference data in Starbase Binary API including InstrumentDefinition messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Reference Data\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to reference data in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/reference-data\"}]},{\"group\":\"Unsolicited Events\",\"expanded\":false,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Starbase Unsolicited Events\",\"description\":\"Server-initiated Starbase Binary API events including OrderFilled fills, MMPTrigger notifications, and liquidation cancels delivered on the originating gateway.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"order entry\",\"OrderFilled\",\"MMPTrigger\",\"unsolicited events\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Unsolicited Events\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to unsolicited events in Starbase Binary API including OrderFilled and MMPTrigger messages.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Unsolicited Events\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to unsolicited events in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/unsolicited-events\"}]},{\"group\":\"REST API\",\"expanded\":true,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"REST Order Gateway Authentication\",\"description\":\"Authenticate requests to the Starbase REST Order Gateway using HTTP Basic credentials, including API key handling and gateway session security.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"REST\",\"authentication\",\"Basic auth\",\"Authorization header\",\"clientId\",\"clientSecret\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase REST Order Gateway Authentication\",\"og:description\":\"Learn how to authenticate to the Starbase REST Order Gateway using the Basic Authorization header scheme.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase REST Authentication\",\"twitter:description\":\"How to authenticate requests to the Starbase REST Order Gateway.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/rest-authentication\"},{\"title\":\"Get Open Orders\",\"description\":\"$a6\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/private/get_open_orders\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/trading/get-open-orders\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Starbase Risk Limits\",\"description\":\"$a7\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/private/get_starbase_risk_limits\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/portfolio-management/get-starbase-risk-limits\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Mass Cancel\",\"description\":\"Cancels all open orders and quotes belonging to the authenticated portfolio. No filter parameters are accepted. The cancel applies to every instrument and every side.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/private/cancel_all\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/portfolio-management/mass-cancel\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Lock Portfolio\",\"description\":\"Locks the authenticated portfolio. All currently open `DIRECT_ACCESS` orders and quotes for this portfolio are cancelled immediately. New `DIRECT_ACCESS` orders and quotes are rejected until the portfolio is unlocked.\\n\\nREST-submitted orders are not affected by the lock state.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/private/lock_portfolio\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/portfolio-management/lock-portfolio\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Unlock Portfolio\",\"description\":\"Unlocks the authenticated portfolio, resuming normal acceptance of `DIRECT_ACCESS` orders and quotes.\\n\\nUnlocking the portfolio does **not** restore any previously cancelled orders.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/private/unlock_portfolio\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/portfolio-management/unlock-portfolio\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List Instruments\",\"description\":\"$a8\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/starbase_rest_openapi.json get /api/v2/public/get_instruments\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/list-instruments\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"FIX Drop Copy\",\"expanded\":false,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Starbase FIX Drop Copy API\",\"description\":\"Starbase FIX Drop Copy delivers a per-Member feed of orders, trades, and executions, with reconciliation guidance for ID mapping, dedup, and gap replay.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"FIX drop copy\",\"FIX protocol\",\"execution reports\",\"trade capture\",\"drop copy\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase FIX Drop Copy API - Order and Trade Reporting\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to FIX Drop Copy API in Starbase for order and trade reporting via FIX protocol, including execution reports and trade capture.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase FIX Drop Copy API\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to FIX Drop Copy API for order and trade reporting in Starbase.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/fix-drop-copy-api\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"Core Concepts\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Market Model\",\"description\":\"The market model of Starbase is a subset of Deribit's market model. In Starbase, instruments are linked with Indices and Underlyings.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"market model\",\"AssetID\",\"underlying ID\",\"instrument states\",\"market states\",\"inverse\",\"linear\",\"instrument model\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Market Model - AssetID, Underlying ID, and Instrument States\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to the market model for Starbase API including AssetID, underlying ID, instrument states, and instrument pricing models.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Market Model\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to the market model for Starbase API including AssetID, underlying ID, and instrument states.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/market-model\"},{\"title\":\"Account Model\",\"description\":\"How the Starbase account and subaccount hierarchy differs from the Deribit main platform for order entry, drop copy, and permission scoping.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"account model\",\"portfolio\",\"member\",\"subaccount\",\"rate limits\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Account Model - Portfolio and Member\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to the account model for Starbase API including Portfolio and Member concepts and their relationship to subaccounts and rate limits.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Account Model\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to the account model for Starbase API including Portfolio and Member concepts.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/account-model\"},{\"title\":\"Underlying Tiers\",\"description\":\"Assets on Starbase are classified into three tiers based on liquidity. Tier assignments determine rate limits and multicast channel assignments.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"tiers\",\"underlying\",\"tier 1\",\"tier 2\",\"tier 3\",\"liquidity\",\"rate limits\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Underlying Tiers\",\"og:description\":\"Classification of Deribit underlyings into three tiers based on liquidity, aligned with Coinbase International Exchange tier assignments.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Underlying Tiers\",\"twitter:description\":\"Classification of Deribit underlyings into three tiers based on liquidity.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/underlying-tiers\"},{\"title\":\"Speed Bumps\",\"description\":\"Speed bumps in Starbase API for options trading, including how aggressive orders are delayed and how market makers are protected from latency arbitrage.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"speed bump\",\"options\",\"latency arbitrage\",\"market maker protection\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Speed Bumps\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to speed bumps in Starbase API for options trading, including how aggressive orders are delayed and market maker protection.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Speed Bumps\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to speed bumps in Starbase API for options trading.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/speed-bumps\"},{\"title\":\"Starbase Market Maker Protection (MMP)\",\"description\":\"Configure and reset Starbase Market Maker Protection thresholds, tag orders as MMP, and understand the per subaccount and base/quote pair MMP scope.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Binary API\",\"MMP\",\"Market Maker Protection\",\"risk management\",\"ResetOrdersMmpRequest\",\"ResetMassQuoteMmpRequest\",\"ResetMmpResponse\",\"ResetMmpReject\",\"GetMassQuoteMmpStatusRequest\",\"GetOrdersMmpStatusRequest\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Binary API - Market Maker Protection (MMP)\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to Market Maker Protection (MMP) in Starbase Binary API including configuration, reset operations, and risk management.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Binary API - Market Maker Protection\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Market Maker Protection (MMP) in Starbase Binary API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/mmp\"},{\"title\":\"Self Match Prevention (SMP)\",\"description\":\"Prevent orders on the same member from matching each other. Configure Self Match Prevention groups and choose the cancel behavior policy.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"SMP\",\"Self Match Prevention\",\"matching engine\",\"order matching\",\"SMPToken\",\"member ID\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Self Match Prevention (SMP) - ME Functionality\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to Self Match Prevention (SMP) in Starbase API for preventing orders from matching with each other.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Self Match Prevention (SMP)\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Self Match Prevention (SMP) functionality in Starbase API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/smp\"},{\"title\":\"Portfolio Management\",\"description\":\"Portfolio-scoped Starbase controls for mass cancellation, direct-access order entry, and lock or unlock endpoints used in risk operations workflows.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"portfolio management\",\"lock portfolio\",\"unlock portfolio\",\"mass cancel\",\"cancel_all\",\"DIRECT_ACCESS\",\"risk management\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase - Portfolio Management\",\"og:description\":\"Portfolio-scoped controls for mass cancellation and direct-access order entry in Starbase.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase - Portfolio Management\",\"twitter:description\":\"Portfolio-scoped controls for mass cancellation and direct-access order entry in Starbase.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/portfolio-management\"}]},{\"group\":\"Technical Information\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Starbase API Rate Limits\",\"description\":\"Rate limiting rules for the Starbase order entry gateways. Covers per-subaccount key quotas, burst-equals-refill defaults, and gateway throttling behavior.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/api-rate-limits\"},{\"title\":\"Risk Bypass\",\"description\":\"How privileged Starbase sessions can bypass pre-trade risk checks for certain low-latency workflows. Covers configuration, scope, and eligibility requirements.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"risk bypass\",\"MMP\",\"Market Maker Protection\",\"risk engine\",\"low latency\",\"order entry\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Risk Bypass - Low-Latency Order Entry\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to risk bypass in Starbase, which allows MMP orders and quotes to bypass the risk engine for low-latency order entry.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Risk Bypass\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to risk bypass in Starbase for low-latency order entry.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/risk-bypass\"},{\"title\":\"Cancel on Disconnect\",\"description\":\"Automatically cancel working orders when a Starbase session drops. Enable Cancel on Disconnect, configure it, and combine it with heartbeats for safety.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"Cancel on Disconnect\",\"CoD\",\"risk management\",\"gateway\",\"connection\",\"order cancellation\",\"SBE\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Cancel on Disconnect - Risk Management Feature\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to Cancel On Disconnect (CoD) in Starbase, a risk management feature that automatically cancels orders when gateway connections are lost.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Cancel on Disconnect\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to Cancel On Disconnect (CoD) risk management feature in Starbase.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/cancel-on-disconnect\"},{\"title\":\"Gateway Connectivity\",\"description\":\"Starbase gateway endpoints, host lists, connection credentials, and network requirements for reaching the order entry and market data servers.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"gateway\",\"connectivity\",\"connections\",\"credentials\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Gateway Connectivity - Connection Information\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to gateway connectivity for Starbase API including gateway servers, connections, and credentials.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Gateway Connectivity\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to gateway connectivity and connection information for Starbase API.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/gateway-connectivity\"},{\"title\":\"Multicast Channels\",\"description\":\"Starbase SBE Market Data Feed multicast channels over UDP. Channel assignments are sharded by product type, with A/B twins for redundancy and low latency.\",\"mode\":\"wide\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"multicast\",\"market data\",\"order book feed\",\"snapshot\",\"incremental\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Channels - Market Data Distribution\",\"og:description\":\"Complete guide to multicast channels for market-by-order feeds in Starbase, including channel assignments by product type and A/B redundancy.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Channels\",\"twitter:description\":\"Complete guide to multicast channels for market data distribution in Starbase.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/multicast-channels\"},{\"title\":\"Multicast Subscription Guide\",\"description\":\"Step-by-step procedure to subscribe and unsubscribe from Starbase UDP multicast market data feeds, including channel discovery and IGMP setup.\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"multicast\",\"subscription\",\"IGMPv3\",\"PIM\",\"BGP\",\"colo\",\"multicast group\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Subscription Guide\",\"og:description\":\"Step-by-step guide for subscribing to and unsubscribing from Starbase Multicast feeds, covering both Colo and Cross-Connect customers.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Subscription Guide\",\"twitter:description\":\"Steps for subscribing to and unsubscribing from Starbase Multicast feeds.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/multicast-subscription-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Multicast Retransmit Gateway\",\"description\":\"Recover missed Starbase multicast messages via the UDP unicast retransmit service. Request ranges by sequence number to fill incremental feed gaps.\",\"keywords\":[\"Starbase\",\"multicast\",\"retransmit\",\"gap fill\",\"SBE\",\"UDP unicast\",\"sequence number\",\"rate limiting\"],\"og:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Retransmit Gateway\",\"og:description\":\"Complete reference for the Starbase retransmit gateway: wire protocol, SBE message formats, cache behavior, rate limiting, and client implementation guidance.\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"twitter:title\":\"Starbase Multicast Retransmit Gateway\",\"twitter:description\":\"Wire protocol and implementation guide for recovering missed multicast messages via the Starbase retransmit gateway.\",\"href\":\"/starbase/retransmit-gateway\"}]}]}]},{\"tab\":\"Changelogs\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Changelogs\",\"href\":\"/changelogs/jsonrpc\"}]}]}]},\"maps\":{\"firstHrefInVersion\":{\"Production\":{\"href\":\"/\",\"matchLevel\":2},\"Upcoming\":{\"href\":\"/\",\"matchLevel\":2}},\"firstHrefInLanguage\":{}},\"children\":\"$La9\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_